update content_bodies set title = 'Okinawa Tourism: Strolling Along the Shopping Streets of ''Ichiba Hondori - Taihei Dori'' on Kokusai Street ♯184 Naha City Okinawa Walk', description = 'This video features a stroll through the shopping streets ''Ichiba Hondori and Taihei Dori'' along Kokusai Street in Naha City. These are some of the few remaining arcade shopping streets in Okinawa. The host, TOMA, has received the COVID-19 vaccine. Given the challenges of visiting the area, this video offers a chance to enjoy a walking experience virtually. For more videos from ''@okinawa👣sanpoⓇ'', visit the provided YouTube channel link.' where id = '-IieF9uLtKVCp2t6mOcsx';
update content_bodies set title = '異国情緒溢れる米軍基地の門前街「金武町 新開地」をさんぽ  ♯183 おきなわさんぽ', description = '金武町にある米軍基地キャンプハンセンの門前に位置する「新開地エリア」を早朝に散策する様子を紹介する動画です。カラフルな建物や英字の看板が並ぶアメリカンな街並みを楽しむことができます。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチンを接種済みです。現地を訪れることが難しい方々に向けて、この動画を通じて街の雰囲気を感じていただければと思います。' where id = 'P4gA5j8lfs5cCBSZ1e0v_';
update content_bodies set title = 'Strolling Through the Exotic Front Street of the U.S. Military Base ''Shinkai Area'' in Kin Town ♯183 Okinawa Walk', description = 'This video features a morning stroll through the ''Shinkai Area'' in Kin Town, located in front of the U.S. military base Camp Hansen. Viewers can enjoy the colorful buildings and American-style signage that characterize this unique neighborhood. The host, TOMA, has been vaccinated against COVID-19. Since visiting the area in person can be challenging, this video offers a chance to experience the atmosphere of the town virtually.' where id = 'IWVlA1ptDSxUw3iwkZvEE';
