update content_bodies set title = '「沖縄県民の休日の風景♯７」うるま市 浜比嘉ビーチ編♯177 おきなわさんぽ', description = '今回の動画では、うるま市の離島にある浜比嘉ビーチを紹介します。海中道路を渡った先に位置し、沖縄の夏が近づく中、県民が海で休日を楽しむ様子をお届けします。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチンを接種済みです。「@おきなわ👣さんぽⓇ」の全動画は、提供されたYouTubeチャンネルリンクからご覧いただけます。現地を訪れることは県外・県内問わず難しいこともあるので、この動画でさんぽ気分を楽しんでください。' where id = 'fzHslEmwqhzZqM9i4myX6';
update content_bodies set title = 'Okinawa Residents'' Holiday Scenery #7: Hamahiga Beach in Uruma City #177 Okinawa Stroll', description = 'This video features Hamahiga Beach, located on a remote island in Uruma City, accessible via the ocean road. As summer in Okinawa approaches, we present scenes of residents enjoying their beach holidays. The content creator, TOMA, has received the COVID-19 vaccine. For more videos from ''@Okinawa Stroll'', visit the provided YouTube channel link. Visiting the area can be challenging for both local and non-local residents, so enjoy the stroll experience through this video.' where id = 'zMgdJnnNs-xNV45ksh9zz';
