update content_bodies set title = '沖縄県民の休日の風景♯５：北谷町 北谷海岸の夕暮れ編', description = '今回の動画では、北谷海岸のアラハビーチからデポアイランド裏のシーサイドロードまでの夕暮れを散歩します。沖縄県民や観光客、米軍関係者が入り混じった、のんびりとした夕暮れの雰囲気をお届けします。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチン接種済みです。県外からの訪問が難しい中、この動画を通じて一緒に散歩気分を楽しんでいただければと思います。' where id = 'GIeheI6eE_QAYYomsbaq-';
update content_bodies set title = 'Scenes of Okinawa Residents'' Holidays #5: Sunset at Chatan Beach (from Araha Beach to Depo Island and Seaside Road)', description = 'This video features a stroll along the sunset at Chatan Beach, from Araha Beach to the Seaside Road behind Depo Island (American Village). It captures a relaxed evening atmosphere with a mix of Okinawa residents, tourists, and U.S. military personnel. The content is presented by TOMA, who has been vaccinated against COVID-19. Since visiting the area can be challenging for those outside Okinawa, this video offers a chance to enjoy the walking experience together.' where id = 'T8vfJ63GY23t_nTCI2bfm';
update content_bodies set title = '沖縄観光: 那覇の国際通り裏通りの昭和の街並みを散歩 - 前編', description = 'この動画では、那覇の国際通り南側の裏通りを散歩し、街の中心に残る昭和の街並みを紹介します。昭和時代の古いオキナワン家屋がこれほど多く残っていることに驚きました。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチン接種済みです。現地を訪れるのが難しい今、動画を通じて散歩気分を楽しんでください。' where id = 'DGULspWafURCmc3CYHM2A';
update content_bodies set title = 'Okinawa Tourism: Exploring the Retro Streets of Naha''s International Street - Part 1', description = 'In this video, we take a stroll through the back streets south of ''Kokusai Dori'' in Naha, showcasing the ''Showa-era streetscape'' that remains in the heart of the city. I was surprised to find so many old Okinawan houses from the Showa period still intact. The host, TOMA, has received the COVID-19 vaccine. Given the challenges of visiting in person, enjoy the walking experience through this video.' where id = '1tcYFe-wlEMdCifvDuua4';
update content_bodies set title = '2021夏！凉！夕暮れの国際通り！ 後編', description = 'この動画は，那覇市の「夕暮れの国際通り」を散歩する後編です。国際通りの名称の由来を紹介しながら、涼しい夕暮れの空気の中で国際通りを楽しむ様子をお届けします。オレンジ色に染まる国際通りを一緒に散歩しましょう。店舗関係者も視聴する可能性があるため、ネガティブなコメントは控えてください。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチン接種済みです。現地を訪れるのが難しい方も、この動画で散歩気分を楽しんでください。' where id = 'Xf37_AKy7QE6evkQpOCFj';
update content_bodies set title = 'Summer 2021! Cool! Evening on Kokusai Street! Part 2', description = 'This video is the second part of a stroll along Naha''s miraculous mile, ''Kokusai Street'' at dusk. Enjoy the cool evening air while learning about the origin of the name ''Kokusai Street.'' Let''s take a walk together through the street bathed in orange hues. Please refrain from negative comments as local shop owners may be watching. The host, TOMA, has been vaccinated against COVID-19. Since visiting the area can be challenging, enjoy the walking experience through this video.' where id = '7aG-1LA5T8olWQo5FfV3t';
update content_bodies set title = '朝日照る 那覇新都心をさんぽ！ 前編', description = '今回は「那覇新都心」をさんぽします。新都心は沖縄で最も整然とした街で、早朝のオレンジ色に染まる街並みを楽しむことができます。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチン接種済みです。現地を訪れることが難しい方も多いと思いますので、この動画で一緒にさんぽ気分を味わってください。' where id = 'zUj6LkNRtYUtbky13qsNh';
update content_bodies set title = 'Morning Stroll in Naha New Town! Part 1', description = 'This video features a stroll through ''Naha New Town,'' the most organized area in Okinawa. Enjoy the streets of New Town bathed in orange hues during the early morning. The host, TOMA, has been vaccinated against COVID-19. Visiting the area can be challenging for both locals and tourists, so join us in this video to experience the walking atmosphere together.' where id = 'OVMEieebeUnayeCF4AfRl';
update content_bodies set title = '沖縄県民の休日の風景♯４：読谷村 渡具知ビーチ編 ♯159 おきなわさんぽ', description = '今回は読谷村の渡具知ビーチを訪れました。米軍基地があるため、米軍関係者も多く、地元の人々も楽しく過ごしていました。この動画を通じて、沖縄県民の休日の雰囲気を感じていただければと思います。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチン接種済みです。「@おきなわさんぽ」の全動画は、こちらからご覧いただけます：https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4onwMScAwqvQyVSibQvRKw/。県外・県内を問わず、現地を訪れるのは難しいこともありますが、この動画で一緒にさんぽ気分を楽しんでください。' where id = 'TDdvV-HmmJ6ahgJwEHE3a';
update content_bodies set title = 'Scenes of Okinawa Residents'' Holidays #4: Toguchi Beach in Yomitan Village #159 Okinawa Stroll', description = 'This time, we visited Toguchi Beach in Yomitan Village. Due to the presence of a U.S. military base, there are many military personnel, and of course, local residents were enjoying their time as well. We hope you can feel the atmosphere of Okinawa residents'' holidays through this video. *The distributor TOMA has been vaccinated against COVID-19. You can find all videos from ''@Okinawa Stroll'' here: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4onwMScAwqvQyVSibQvRKw/. It can be quite difficult to visit the site, whether from outside or within the prefecture. Enjoy the stroll feeling with us through this video.' where id = 'QxGsAmAZu4G-xvhVKL3TN';
update content_bodies set title = '「モノレールから沖縄の風景」前編 那覇空港駅～牧志駅', description = '今回の動画は、空中散歩「モノレールから沖縄の風景 for 4K」です。沖縄の市街地を異なるアングルから見ることで、県民にとっても新鮮な体験となるでしょう。前回の動画が“上り”陸側の風景だったのに対し、今回は“下り”海側の風景を全編お届けします。那覇空港駅から牧志駅までの景色を楽しんでください。また、テロップに誤記があり、赤嶺駅前の国道58号線が正しくは国道331号線であることをお詫びします。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチン接種済みです。現地を訪れるのが難しい方も、この動画でさんぽ気分を楽しんでいただければと思います。' where id = 'yX9kan02zQwxjYiat0gPU';
update content_bodies set title = 'Okinawa Scenery from the Monorail: Part 1 Naha Airport Station to Makishi Station', description = 'This video features an aerial stroll titled ''Okinawa Scenery from the Monorail for 4K.'' The urban landscape of Okinawa viewed from a different angle is refreshing even for locals. Unlike the previous video that showcased the ''upward'' land side, this one presents the ''downward'' sea side scenery in its entirety, from Naha Airport Station to Makishi Station. Enjoy the feeling of an aerial walk. Please note a correction regarding a typo in the subtitles: Akamine Station (incorrect: National Route 58 → correct: National Route 331). The presenter, TOMA, has been vaccinated against COVID-19. For more videos from ''@Okinawa Stroll,'' visit the provided YouTube channel link. Visiting the area can be challenging, so enjoy this virtual stroll together.' where id = '7Oq2feJhvhPHd-ByLMV5b';
update content_bodies set title = '2021夏！凉！夕暮れの国際通り」最高の散歩道 ♯157 那覇市  おきなわさんぽ  沖縄観光 沖縄旅行', description = 'この動画では、那覇市の奇跡の1マイル「夕暮れの国際通り」を散歩します。夕暮れの涼しい空気の中での国際通りは最高の体験です。オレンジ色に染まる国際通りを一緒に歩きましょう。店舗関係者も視聴する可能性があるため、ネガティブなコメントは控えてください。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチン接種済みです。「@おきなわ👣さんぽⓇ」の全動画は、提供されたYouTubeリンクからご覧いただけます。現地を訪れるのは難しいこともあるので、この動画で散歩気分を楽しんでください。' where id = '3rSh3ljVBPj4_FFEzyegF';
update content_bodies set title = 'Summer 2021! Cool! The International Street at Dusk - The Best Walking Path ♯157 Naha City Okinawa', description = 'In this video, we take a stroll along the miraculous one-mile ''International Street'' in Naha City. The cool evening air makes walking along International Street a delightful experience. Join me as we walk through the street bathed in orange hues at dusk. Please refrain from negative comments, as store staff may also be watching. The host, TOMA, has been vaccinated against COVID-19. For more videos from ''@okinawa👣sampoⓇ'', visit the provided YouTube link. Visiting the area can be challenging, so enjoy the walking experience through this video.' where id = 'jjRhKnuOwEFqT44M0Nd1n';
update content_bodies set title = 'ソーキそば発祥の店 我部祖河食堂本店', description = '今回は名護市にある「ソーキそば発祥の店 我部祖河食堂本店」を訪れた様子をお届けします。オープニングでは「リアルな沖縄のパイン畑」を紹介し、エンディングでは「羽地湾」に浮かぶ「古宇利島・屋我地島」を収録しています。ご視聴ありがとうございます。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチン接種済みです。「@おきなわ👣さんぽⓇ」の全動画はYouTubeリンクからご覧いただけます。現地を訪れるのが難しい方も、この動画でさんぽ気分を楽しんでいただければ幸いです。' where id = 'FbRJGgDbMzMY3PYLFLfKf';
update content_bodies set title = 'The Origin of Soki Soba: Gabe Sogawa Shokudo Main Store', description = 'This video features a visit to the ''Gabe Sogawa Shokudo Main Store'' in Nago City, known as the birthplace of Soki Soba. It includes an opening segment showcasing a ''real Okinawan pineapple field'' and an ending segment featuring ''Kouri Island and Yagaji Island'' floating in Hanegawa Bay. Thank you for watching. TOMA. The content creator, TOMA, has been vaccinated against COVID-19. For more videos from ''@Okinawa Sanpo'', visit the provided YouTube link. Visiting the location can be challenging, so enjoy the walking experience through this video.' where id = '04eIsYDs2qa0XJ4cOV8XI';
update content_bodies set title = '沖縄県民の休日の風景♯３ 米軍人家族 in 嘉手納マリーナ編', description = '今日は、米軍の専用施設「嘉手納マリーナ」で、米軍人家族の休日の風景を撮影しました。日本とは異なるアメリカンな雰囲気をお楽しみください。日本人が利用できるのはレストランSEASIDEのみで、ビーチの利用可否は確認できませんでした。配信者のTOMAはコロナワクチンを2回接種済みで、撮影中は感染対策を十分に行っています。県外・県内を問わず、現地を訪れるのは難しい状況ですが、この動画で一緒にさんぽ気分を味わっていただければと思います。' where id = 'vXaaFkkJOMrFBjvBJr-yE';
update content_bodies set title = 'Scenes of Okinawa Residents'' Holidays #3: U.S. Military Families at Kadena Marina', description = 'Today, I captured the holiday scenes of U.S. military families at the exclusive facility ''Kadena Marina.'' Experience the American atmosphere that differs from Japan! Note that the only area accessible to Japanese people is the SEASIDE restaurant, and I could not confirm the availability of the beach. The presenter, TOMA, has received two doses of the COVID-19 vaccine and took sufficient infection control measures during filming. Enjoy a stroll with us through this video, as visiting the location can be quite challenging for both locals and visitors from outside the prefecture.' where id = 'HfWt6vH_SRrjuCVSmZkwB';
update content_bodies set title = '癒やしの空間を散歩 「備瀬 びせ フク木並木｣   ♯125 【４K】おきなわさんぽ', description = 'この動画では、沖縄の美しい備瀬フク木並木を散歩する様子を紹介しています。県外からの訪問者にとって、現地の観光地を訪れることが難しいことを考慮し、視聴者がバーチャルで散歩気分を楽しめるように工夫されています。静かな雰囲気と自然の美しさを堪能できる内容となっています。さらに多くの動画は、おきなわさんぽのYouTubeチャンネルでご覧いただけます。' where id = '4xU_OkWN4gfyRNg1qqa1x';
update content_bodies set title = 'Healing Space Walk: Bise Fukugi Tree Lined Path ♯125 【4K】 Okinawa Stroll', description = 'This video invites viewers to enjoy a stroll through the beautiful Bise Fukugi Tree Lined Path in Okinawa. It highlights the challenges of visiting local attractions, especially for those from outside the prefecture. The video aims to provide a virtual walking experience, allowing viewers to appreciate the serene atmosphere and natural beauty of the area. For more videos, visit the Okinawa Stroll channel on YouTube.' where id = 'ZWWvouFV7LzFl7oRY_n6X';
update content_bodies set title = '甲斐みのりの かわいいわかやま　第１話', description = '和歌山は実は喫茶店王国です。文筆家の甲斐みのりさんが、どこか懐かしく居心地の良い純喫茶を巡ります。あの憧れの純喫茶で、ノスタルジックなひとときを過ごしてみませんか。' where id = 'ZaH_2ZRllnVwre-prRMRi';
update content_bodies set title = 'Minori Kai''s Cute Wakayama Episode 1', description = 'Wakayama is actually a kingdom of coffee shops! Writer Minori Kai explores nostalgic and cozy pure coffee shops. Would you like to spend a nostalgic moment in that longed-for pure coffee shop?' where id = 'MQAX8hWT19ErVb9dzBN7U';
update content_bodies set title = '花粉も邪気も吹き飛ばすー【“秘境の村”北山村へ】', description = '和歌山県北山村は、三重県と奈良県に囲まれた日本唯一の“飛び地”の村です。人口約380人で、面積の93％が山と森に覆われた自然豊かな環境が特徴です。この村では、幻の柑橘「じゃばら」や全国唯一の「観光筏下り」など、地域の恵みを活かした文化が息づいています。静かで誇り高い秘境を訪れ、ここにしかない暮らしを体験してみませんか。' where id = '1BjWRH3k3Wqu3CzGdH1Dm';
update content_bodies set title = 'Blow Away Pollen and Evil Spirits - To the ''Secret Village'' of Kitayama Village', description = 'Kitayama Village, located in Wakayama Prefecture, is Japan''s only ''detached'' village, completely surrounded by Mie and Nara prefectures and not connected to other municipalities in Wakayama. With a population of about 380 and 93% of its area covered by mountains and forests, this village offers a unique lifestyle deeply rooted in nature. Visitors can experience the local culture, which includes the rare citrus fruit ''jabara'' and the only ''tourist rafting'' in the country. Discover this proud and secluded village that thrives on the blessings of its land.' where id = 'HQKJKPA20TkixnbnsnHar';
update content_bodies set title = '熊野御幸の足跡をたどる旅 ―祈りの道「熊野古道」をゆく―【熊野御幸ゆかりの御朱印めぐり】', description = '熊野古道は、京都をはじめとする各地から熊野三山（熊野本宮大社、熊野速玉大社、熊野那智大社・那智山青岸渡寺）へ続く参詣道であり、その一部が「紀伊山地の霊場と参詣道」として世界遺産に登録されています。この道は古くから人々の祈りを運び、再生の地へと導く「よみがえりの道」として知られています。特に、上皇や法皇が都から熊野を目指して旅した「熊野御幸」がこの道の起源です。この記事では、日本における観光の始まりとも言われる熊野御幸の壮大な巡礼の旅について紹介します。' where id = '9XIzQSrH9zTFJeG8Wr8O7';
update content_bodies set title = 'Journey Following the Footsteps of Kumano Gokō - Walking the Sacred Path ''Kumano Kodo'' - [Exploring the Pilgrimage Stamps Related to Kumano Gokō]', description = 'Kumano Kodo is a pilgrimage route leading from various locations, including Kyoto, to the three Kumano shrines (Kumano Hongu Taisha, Kumano Hayatama Taisha, Kumano Nachi Taisha and Nachi San Seiganto-ji). Parts of the Nakahechi and Ohechi routes are registered as a UNESCO World Heritage site under ''Sacred Sites and Pilgrimage Routes in the Kii Mountain Range.'' This ancient path has long carried the prayers of people, guiding them to a place of rebirth, known as the ''Path of Resurrection.'' The journey of noble individuals from the capital to Kumano, referred to as ''Kumano Gokō,'' marks the beginning of this route. This article introduces the grand pilgrimage journey undertaken by emperors and priests from Kyoto through Osaka to the three Kumano shrines.' where id = 'jJhcqDCQuG9Hmh89Oha0D';
update content_bodies set title = '今日は和歌山の日　～ペット旅～', description = '愛犬と一緒に楽しむ1泊2日のモデルプランで、有田、日高、和歌山市を巡ります。フルーツ狩りや海沿いのカフェ、グランピング、映える写真が撮れるアミューズメント施設などが含まれています。愛犬と共に楽しめるペットフレンドリーなスポットを巡るおすすめのプランです。' where id = '1F0fRP0CLO3fnCc6mw2-5';
update content_bodies set title = 'Wakayama Day - Pet Travel', description = 'This is a model plan for a one-night, two-day trip with your beloved dog, exploring the areas of Arida, Hidaka, and Wakayama City. The itinerary includes fruit picking, seaside cafes, glamping, and amusement facilities where you can take Instagram-worthy photos. It is a recommended plan that allows you to enjoy pet-friendly spots with your dog.' where id = 'MP9jNMg_bXkMn3zT7GN6k';
update content_bodies set title = '今日は和歌山の日　～夫婦旅～', description = '夫婦で楽しむ田辺・白浜の1泊2日のモデルプランです。まず、元小学校をリノベーションした体験型施設で、地元特産の柑橘を使ったフルーツ作り体験や、地元のお母さんたちの手作りランチを楽しみます。その後、和歌山のウユニ塩湖とも称される天神崎で映え写真を撮影。2日目は、ジャイアントパンダなど多くの動物がいるアドベンチャーワールドや白良浜ビーチを散策し、レトロなカフェや夕陽が美しい千畳敷にも立ち寄ります。オーシャンビューの絶景露天風呂が楽しめるホテルに宿泊し、田辺・白浜を満喫する夫婦旅のおすすめプランです。' where id = 'hCqSfXGKwI4lnXwpUGGOw';
update content_bodies set title = 'Wakayama Day - Couple''s Trip', description = 'This is a model plan for a 1-night, 2-day trip to Tanabe and Shirahama, designed for couples. The journey begins at a renovated former elementary school, where visitors can enjoy hands-on experiences like making fruit products using local citrus. After a homemade lunch prepared by local mothers, the trip continues to Tenjinsaki, known for its picturesque views reminiscent of the Uyuni Salt Flats. On the second day, couples can explore Adventure World, home to giant pandas and various animals, stroll along Shirarahama Beach, visit retro cafes, and enjoy the beautiful sunset at Chichibugahama. The trip concludes with a relaxing stay at a hotel featuring an ocean-view open-air bath, making it a perfect getaway for couples to enjoy the beauty of Tanabe and Shirahama.' where id = '9b3Qm_iTABYyLD4Rwb_wo';
update content_bodies set title = '今日は和歌山の日　～夫婦旅～', description = '夫婦で楽しむ田辺・白浜の1泊2日のモデルプランです。まず、元小学校をリノベーションした体験型施設で、地元特産の柑橘を使ったフルーツ作り体験や、地元のお母さんたちの手作りランチを楽しみます。その後、和歌山のウユニ塩湖とも称される天神崎で映え写真を撮影します。2日目は、ジャイアントパンダをはじめとする多くの動物がいるアドベンチャーワールドや、白良浜ビーチの散策、レトロなカフェや夕陽が美しい千畳敷にも立ち寄り、白浜を満喫します。オーシャンビューの絶景露天風呂が楽しめるホテルに宿泊し、ゆったりとした時間を過ごす、夫婦旅におすすめのプランです。' where id = 'P0rTv9uM6ymsyovMj_Fj0';
update content_bodies set title = 'Wakayama Day - Couple''s Trip', description = 'This is a model plan for a 1-night, 2-day trip to Tanabe and Shirahama, perfect for couples. The journey begins at a renovated former elementary school, where visitors can enjoy hands-on experiences like making fruit products using local citrus fruits and savoring homemade lunches prepared by local mothers. Afterward, they can capture stunning photos at Tenjinsaki, often referred to as Wakayama''s ''Uyuni Salt Lake.'' On the second day, the itinerary includes a visit to Adventure World, home to giant pandas and various other animals, a stroll along Shirarahama Beach, and stops at retro cafes and the picturesque Chichibugahama Beach, known for its beautiful sunsets. The trip concludes with a relaxing stay at a hotel featuring an ocean-view open-air bath, making it an ideal getaway for couples looking to explore Tanabe and Shirahama.' where id = 'ZhUExRnu9h5i-gZgFCU85';
update content_bodies set title = '今日は和歌山の日　～夫婦旅～', description = '夫婦で楽しむ田辺・白浜の1泊2日のモデルプランです。まず、リノベーションされた元小学校で、特産の柑橘を使ったフルーツ作り体験や地元のお母さんたちの手作りランチを楽しみます。その後、和歌山のウユニ塩湖とも称される天神崎で映え写真を撮影します。2日目は、ジャイアントパンダなど多くの動物がいるアドベンチャーワールドを訪れ、白良浜ビーチを散策し、レトロなカフェや夕陽が美しい千畳敷にも立ち寄ります。オーシャンビューの絶景露天風呂が楽しめるホテルに宿泊し、田辺・白浜を満喫する夫婦旅のおすすめプランです。' where id = 'pTnlnyKFbd2BEprNe5-L_';
update content_bodies set title = 'Wakayama Day - Couple''s Trip', description = 'This is a model plan for a 1-night, 2-day trip to Tanabe and Shirahama, designed for couples. The journey begins at a renovated former elementary school, where visitors can enjoy a fruit-making experience using local citrus fruits and savor homemade lunch prepared by local mothers. Afterward, they head to Tenjinsaki, known for its picturesque views reminiscent of the Uyuni Salt Flats. On the second day, the itinerary includes a visit to Adventure World, home to giant pandas and various other animals, followed by a stroll along Shirarahama Beach, a stop at a retro café, and enjoying the beautiful sunset at Chichibujima. The trip concludes with a relaxing stay at a hotel featuring an ocean-view open-air bath, making it a perfect getaway for couples to explore Tanabe and Shirahama.' where id = 'fwFv-t9eDbX_kEc4p10c6';
update content_bodies set title = '名古屋発！「Re: 和歌山・熊野の”とっておき”に出逢う。」', description = '名古屋から熊野への旅を提案します。世界遺産である熊野三山や熊野古道、温泉、絶景、グルメ、アクティビティなど、熊野には多くの魅力が詰まっています。この旅を通じて、あなた自身の「とっておき」を見つけることができるでしょう。' where id = 'tGFYFTCNEMFvqeFGX1gQD';
update content_bodies set title = 'Discover the Hidden Gems of Kumano from Nagoya', description = 'Embark on a journey from Nagoya to Kumano, a region rich in attractions such as the World Heritage Sites of Kumano Sanzan, the Kumano Kodo pilgrimage routes, hot springs, stunning views, gourmet food, and various activities. This trip promises to help you find your own ''hidden gem'' in Kumano.' where id = 'BWcMqquKiBh65OJZvi1My';
update content_bodies set title = '一生に一度は行きたい和歌山の絶景7選！', description = '和歌山県は海・山・川など自然の宝庫で、様々な絶景スポットがあります。特に本州最南端の地「串本」と清流の町「古座川」のビューポイントを紹介します。訪れたい場所があれば、ぜひいいね！やコメントをお願いします。また、和歌山の観光スポットについての質問や紹介してほしい場所があれば、コメントで教えてください。「わかやま観光 和歌山県公式観光サイト」では、イベントや体験、グルメ情報、世界遺産熊野古道などのモデルプラン、高野山などの見どころを紹介しています。' where id = 'rXwna6_oH57TxUthoC2Vl';
update content_bodies set title = '7 Scenic Spots in Wakayama You Must Visit at Least Once!', description = 'Wakayama Prefecture is a treasure trove of nature, featuring stunning landscapes including mountains, rivers, and the sea. This article highlights particularly scenic viewpoints in the southernmost part of Honshu, ''Kushimoto,'' and the picturesque town of ''Kozagawa.'' If you find a place you''d like to visit, please like and comment! We also welcome your suggestions for other tourist spots in Wakayama or any questions you may have. For more information on events, experiences, and gourmet options, visit the official Wakayama tourism website, which also features model plans for exploring World Heritage sites like the Kumano Kodo and the sacred site of Mount Koya.' where id = 'B9TKrx23ht5zaFlTSIiZj';
update content_bodies set title = '一生に一度は行きたい和歌山の絶景7選：串本・古座川エリア', description = '和歌山県は海・山・川など自然の宝庫で、様々な絶景スポットがあります。この記事では、本州最南端の地「串本」と清流の町「古座川」の特に美しいビューポイントを紹介します。紹介されるスポットには、国の天然記念物に指定されている「橋杭岩」、美しい灯台がある「樫野崎」、鋭い奇岩がそそり立つ「海金剛」、本土と紀伊大島をつなぐ「くしもと大橋」、本州最南端の青い海を間近で見られる「潮岬」、古座川の清流と奇岩を楽しめる「滝の拝」、高さ100m・幅500mの巨大な岩山「一枚岩」が含まれています。訪れたい場所があれば、ぜひいいね！やコメントをお願いします。' where id = 'hYqU4QXmIJWAHtlPhbKHX';
update content_bodies set title = '7 Scenic Spots in Wakayama You Must Visit at Least Once: Kushimoto and Kozagawa Area', description = 'Wakayama Prefecture is a treasure trove of nature, featuring stunning landscapes including mountains, rivers, and the sea. This article highlights the breathtaking viewpoints in Kushimoto, the southernmost point of Honshu, and the clear stream town of Kozagawa. Notable locations include Hashigui-iwa, a national natural monument; the beautiful lighthouse at Kashinozaki; the striking coastal rock formations at Umikongo; the Kushimoto Ohashi bridge connecting the mainland to Kii Oshima; the scenic Shionomisaki; the picturesque Takinohai along the Kozagawa; and the massive rock formation known as Ichima-iwa. Readers are encouraged to like and comment on places they wish to visit or suggest other attractions in Wakayama.' where id = 'gvqtRsQVWYaRa64uy9eto';
update content_bodies set title = '【最強】天然クエ超豪華フルコースが食える和歌山の旅館が凄すぎた', description = '「クエ」と呼ばれる幻の高級魚は、和歌山県で本場のクエ料理を楽しむことができます。ぷりぷりの食感と、皮と身の間にあるコラーゲン、濃厚な旨味の白身が絶品です。和歌山では天然・養殖のクエが通年提供されており、貴重なクエを味わうことができます。様々なクエ料理が紹介されており、興味がある方はぜひ和歌山を訪れてクエを食べてみてください。また、和歌山の観光スポットについての質問やリクエストもコメントで受け付けています。' where id = '5mW1x_Vf3joKLq5Eg5Sy5';
update content_bodies set title = 'The Ultimate Natural Kue Full Course Experience in Wakayama', description = 'Known as a ''phantom luxury fish,'' Kue is a delicacy that can be enjoyed in Wakayama Prefecture, where Kue fishing has been popular for a long time. The dish is celebrated for its firm texture and the rich flavor of its white meat, enhanced by collagen found between the skin and flesh. Wakayama offers both wild and farmed Kue throughout the year, making it a rare treat. Various Kue dishes are introduced, encouraging visitors to experience this culinary delight in Wakayama. Additionally, the description invites readers to share their favorite tourist spots or questions about Wakayama in the comments. For more information on events, experiences, and gourmet options in Wakayama, the official tourism website is recommended.' where id = 'qiU1KpGo1v7KZ4xsfnzYM';
update content_bodies set title = '和歌山白浜', description = '和歌山で海外リゾートステイの気分を味わえる！パノラマの水平線を眺めながらの海沿いサイクリングや、無人島でのラグジュアリーなグランピング、BBQなど、白浜で楽しむことができます。' where id = 'LRMr8RIIzsE7pN4pjYneP';
update content_bodies set title = 'Wakayama Shirahama', description = 'Experience a taste of an overseas resort stay in Wakayama! Enjoy seaside cycling while gazing at the panoramic horizon, indulge in luxurious glamping and BBQ on a deserted island... All of this can be experienced in Shirahama, Wakayama!' where id = 'feOiiIpOl778LPdJ3a915';
update content_bodies set title = '和歌山県那智勝浦', description = '和歌山県熊野エリアは「人生で一度は行きたい」聖地であり、今こそ訪れるべきパワースポットです。熊野古道の神聖な空気を感じ、幻の「もち鮪」を味わい、太平洋を望む絶景の露天風呂で癒される極上のネイチャリング体験が待っています。「紀伊山地の霊場と参詣道」は世界文化遺産に登録され、2024年には20周年を迎えます。' where id = '1IqPvUP1t-SiwlpnZt4lt';
update content_bodies set title = 'Wakayama Nachikatsuura', description = 'The Kumano area in Wakayama Prefecture is a sacred place that everyone should visit at least once in their lifetime. It is a power spot that you should experience now. Enjoy the sacred atmosphere of the Kumano Kodo, savor the elusive ''mochi tuna,'' and relax in an open-air bath with a breathtaking view of the Pacific Ocean. This is an ultimate nature experience! The ''Sacred Sites and Pilgrimage Routes in the Kii Mountain Range'' have been registered as a UNESCO World Heritage Site and will celebrate its 20th anniversary in 2024.' where id = 'DRSqccFZ5LPn2cqE-Kuix';
update content_bodies set title = '紀州浪漫 2023春　日本とトルコ　友好の原点の地へ', description = '日本とトルコは、遠く離れた国同士でありながら、固い絆を持っています。その背景には、明治期に串本沖で起きたトルコ船籍の「エルトゥールル号」の遭難事件があります。この歴史的な出来事を知ることで、両国の友好の理由が見えてきます。歴史に思いを馳せながら、美しい海景を心ゆくまで楽しむことができるでしょう。' where id = 'OcZjh8XBhBY0mgX928Ks4';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kishu Romance Spring 2023: The Origin of Friendship between Japan and Turkey', description = 'Japan and Turkey share a strong bond despite being far apart. The tragic incident involving the Turkish ship ''Ertuğrul'' off the coast of Kushimoto during the Meiji period reveals the reasons behind this connection. As we reflect on history, we are invited to enjoy the beautiful seascapes.' where id = '7rmx9yfwSVvAIzDv_dIN5';
update content_bodies set title = '紀州浪漫 2021夏 「和歌山でSUP体験」', description = '和歌山県北部に位置する和歌山市和歌浦は、ウインドサーフィンやヨットなどのマリンスポーツのメッカです。セーリングのナショナルトレーニングセンターもあるこの地域は、SUPを気軽に楽しむのにも最適な海の条件を備えています。体験メニューや周辺のグルメ情報などの詳細は、6月1日に発行される紀州浪漫夏号で紹介される予定です。' where id = 'Lb47ycMJ4pQG0zwPunTCW';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kishu Romance Summer 2021: SUP Experience in Wakayama', description = 'Wakayama City, located in the northern part of Wakayama Prefecture, is a hub for marine sports such as windsurfing and yachting. With excellent conditions for sailing, including the presence of a national training center, it is also a great place to enjoy Stand-Up Paddleboarding (SUP). Detailed information about experience menus and local gourmet options will be featured in the summer issue of Kishu Romance, published on June 1.' where id = 'SPtEGo6DpptbEnLEbZ2-5';
update content_bodies set title = 'サイクリング王国わかやま WAKAYAMA800を走る　～くじらの町 太地から色川へヒルクライム～', description = 'ツールド熊野のステージでもある太地の町を走り抜け、海と別れを告げた後は、太田川の清らかな水を眺めながら、のどかな山間の集落をのんびりと走ります。さらに、山の中腹に位置する集落「色川」へ続く上り坂を越えると、素晴らしい眺望が広がります。' where id = 'UEOIcFIegCqLCAQuE66Hf';
update content_bodies set title = 'Cycling Kingdom Wakayama: Riding WAKAYAMA800 from Taiji, the Town of Whales, to Irokawa', description = 'This cycling route takes you through Taiji, a town featured in the Tour de Kumano, where you bid farewell to the sea. As you ride, enjoy the clear waters of the Ota River and the serene mountain villages. The journey continues with a climb to the village of Irokawa, where breathtaking views await after navigating the uphill path.' where id = 'aZwqn1WkjiXKVfHrhM6AM';
update content_bodies set title = 'サイクリング王国わかやまWAKAYAMA800　熊野の清流をゆくwithキナンサイクリングチーム', description = 'ツールド熊野のSTAGE1の舞台である赤木川コースを、キナンサイクリングチームのトップ選手たちと平野由香里さんが走ります。このコースは、清流の美しさに心が洗われる素晴らしいルートです。普段は見ることのできない選手たちのにこやかな表情にも注目してください！' where id = 'JlwLqRgboK3jTVb31sICb';
update content_bodies set title = 'Cycling Kingdom Wakayama WAKAYAMA800: Riding the Clear Streams of Kumano with the Kinans Cycling Team', description = 'The Akagi River course serves as the stage for Stage 1 of the Tour de Kumano. Remarkably, top athletes from the Kinans Cycling Team, along with Yukari Hirano, will be riding this course. It is a wonderful route that cleanses the heart with the beauty of the clear streams. Don''t miss the cheerful expressions of the athletes, which are rarely seen!' where id = 'xHu1lwPicRIm4C5UwRmAl';
update content_bodies set title = 'サイクリング王国わかやま WAKAYAMA800を走る　～白と碧の絶景 白崎海岸から湯浅の古い町並みと箕島漁港へ～', description = '白崎海岸の真っ白な岩場と紺碧の海の美しいコントラストを楽しみながら、有田市までサイクリングを行います。途中、醤油醸造で知られる湯浅の古い町並みに立ち寄り、有田の海を見渡せる有田みかん海道を経て、箕島漁港に新しく誕生したスポット「浜のうたせ」でゴールします。サイクリストは人気のサイクリングインフルエンサー、平野由香里さんです。' where id = 'P-M23a5Sym00kxffOvNYS';
update content_bodies set title = 'Cycling Kingdom Wakayama: Riding WAKAYAMA800 - Stunning Views from Shirazaki Coast to the Historic Town of Yuasa and Minoshima Fishing Port', description = 'This cycling journey begins at Shirazaki Coast, where the striking contrast of white rocks and deep blue sea captivates. Cyclists will ride through the historic streets of Yuasa, known for its soy sauce production, before heading along the Arita Mikan Highway, which offers scenic views of Arita''s coastline. The ride concludes at the newly established spot ''Hama no Utase'' at Minoshima Fishing Port. The journey is led by popular cycling influencer Yukari Hirano.' where id = 'cBiCGhCN-tS-Ol2_IOfnr';
update content_bodies set title = '冬の秘密の楽しみ方！グランピング＆サウナで新たな冒険に出よう', description = '上富良野町で冬のアウトドア体験を楽しむ様子を紹介する動画です。東京の女子大生が、北海道の美しい自然の中でグランピング、テントサウナ、スノーシューを体験します。グランピングでは、雪景色を望む快適なテントで贅沢なバーベキューや焚火を楽しみながら、リラックスした時間を過ごします。また、テントサウナで体を温め、ストレスを忘れてリフレッシュすることができます。サウナの後には、十勝岳の温泉で癒しのひとときを過ごすことも可能です。この冬、自然とのふれあいと贅沢なアウトドア体験を求めるなら、上富良野町が最適な場所です。スノーシューを履いて、専門ガイドと共に雪深い森林を探検し、冬ならではの美しい景色を楽しみましょう。' where id = 'EBrr8nE0rr5TaUmDDYI_c';
update content_bodies set title = 'Winter''s Secret Enjoyment! Let''s Embark on a New Adventure with Glamping and Sauna', description = 'Experience winter outdoor activities in Kamifurano, Hokkaido! This video showcases a Tokyo university student enjoying glamping, tent sauna, and snowshoeing amidst the beautiful nature of Kamifurano. Glamping offers a luxurious outdoor experience with comfortable tents overlooking snowy mountains, allowing for relaxation on warm beds and special moments with gourmet barbecues and campfires. Don''t miss the indulgent tent sauna experience to warm up your chilled body and refresh your mind in nature. After the sauna, you can also relax in the hot springs of Tokachidake. For those seeking a connection with nature and a luxurious outdoor experience this winter, Kamifurano is the perfect destination. Check out this video and start preparing for your winter adventure! Explore deep forests with snowshoes, guided by experts, and enjoy the unique winter scenery.' where id = 'kpXOctDEkRhJ9pMpCxMj5';
update content_bodies set title = 'ラベンダーフェスタかみふらの2023', description = '2023年7月、小高い丘の上にある上富良野町の日の出公園で「ラベンダーフェスタかみふらの」が開催され、夜のラベンダーを楽しむことができました。今年はラベンダーが上富良野町の花になって42年目で、日の出ラベンダー園がライトアップされ、町民や全国、海外からの訪問者が夜間もラベンダーを楽しみました。7月16日には、かみふらのPR大使の牧野由依さんのミニライブや杉谷拳士さんのトークショーなどのステージイベントが行われ、フェスタは最高潮に達しました。これらの特別イベントをまとめた動画もアップされていますので、ぜひご覧ください。' where id = 'wxv1at3AWUi5aMwSPH2al';
update content_bodies set title = 'Lavender Festa Kamifurano 2023', description = 'In July 2023, the ''Lavender Festa Kamifurano'' was held at Hinode Park in Kamifurano Town, where visitors could enjoy the beauty of lavender at night. This year marks the 42nd anniversary of lavender being the town flower of Kamifurano. The Hinode Lavender Garden was illuminated for a limited time, allowing both locals and visitors from across Japan and abroad to appreciate the town''s flower even after sunset. On July 16, a stage event took place, featuring a mini live performance by PR ambassador Yui Makino and a talk show by Kenshi Sugiya, making the festival a highlight of the summer. A video summarizing these special events has been uploaded for viewing.' where id = 'k0pYAwoyRk-Yd5Rb4xdEr';
update content_bodies set title = 'ジオガイドと行く、十勝岳　氷瀑ツアー　法華の滝2022', description = '十勝岳温泉郷に位置する「法華の滝 氷瀑ツアー」の案内です。このツアーでは、十勝岳ジオパークのガイドと共に滝を目指します。氷瀑の美しさを楽しみながら、自然の魅力を学ぶことができる貴重な体験です。' where id = 'fhG3Yw95gyjGKs_Ht3tOp';
update content_bodies set title = 'Tokachidake Icefall Tour with a Geo Guide - Hokka Falls 2022', description = 'This is an introduction to the ''Hokka Falls Icefall Tour'' located in the Tokachidake Onsen area. This time, we will head towards the waterfall accompanied by a Tokachidake Geopark guide.' where id = 'hgQrpjLerbgAzmewqF_Vl';
update content_bodies set title = 'LIVE 35th北の大文字カウントダウン2021－2022 北海道上富良野町', description = '「北の大文字」は、元旦午前0時に上富良野町の日の出公園の斜面に、70m×50mの「大」の文字を描く幻想的なイベントです。300本の鉄杭にかみふらの神社からの御神火を灯し、雪に覆われた斜面に大文字を浮かび上がらせます。35回目を迎える今年は、大文字と花火で新年を祝います。新型コロナウイルス感染症の影響で無観客での開催となりますが、ライブ配信を通じて上富良野町の魅力を世界に発信します。イベントスケジュールには、カウントダウンや大文字点火、町長の挨拶、花火打ち上げが含まれています。' where id = '4eBTaZS_tUp7KYQ11_Tti';
update content_bodies set title = 'LIVE 35th Northern Big Character Countdown 2021-2022 in Kamifurano, Hokkaido', description = 'The ''Northern Big Character'' event takes place at midnight on New Year''s Day, where a 70m by 50m ''Big'' character is illuminated on a snowy slope in Hinode Park, Kamifurano, using 300 iron stakes lit with sacred fire from Kamifurano Shrine. This spectacular event has become a beloved New Year''s tradition for the local community. Celebrating its 35th year, the event will feature the lighting of the character and fireworks, creating a dynamic and magical atmosphere to welcome the new year. Due to the ongoing COVID-19 pandemic, the event will be held without an audience, but it will be live-streamed to showcase the charm of Kamifurano to the world. The schedule includes a countdown, lighting of the character, greetings from the mayor, and a fireworks display.' where id = 'jKLIBPCrx29kPzkCQN_G1';
update content_bodies set title = '【4K空撮】2020北海道十勝岳温泉の絶景', description = '北海道の十勝岳温泉は、紅葉を観ることができる最も早い場所の一つです。2020年の紅葉は、台風の影響が少なく、初雪も遅れたため、山頂付近にのみ降雪があり、例年よりも長い期間美しい紅葉を楽しむことができました。多くの人々が登山をし、紅葉の写真を撮影している姿が印象的でした。' where id = 'Zk0GF_Ef-8gh3rGngLA6j';
update content_bodies set title = 'Stunning Aerial Footage of Tokachidake Onsen in Hokkaido 2020', description = 'Tokachidake Onsen, located in Hokkaido, is known for being one of the first places to witness autumn foliage. In 2020, the fall colors were particularly vibrant due to minimal impact from typhoons and a delayed first snowfall. Snowfall occurred only near the mountain summit, allowing for an extended viewing period of the beautiful autumn leaves. Many visitors were seen hiking and capturing photographs of the stunning scenery.' where id = 'YqKigQmENSkSjRvCwOQfM';
update content_bodies set title = '2019十勝岳温泉郷の紅葉', description = '十勝岳温泉は、北海道の中でも最も早く紅葉を楽しむことができる場所として知られています。2019年の晴れた日に撮影された十勝岳温泉郷の美しい紅葉の様子をまとめています。' where id = 'HYRqVTYTqqnlhG7ve_4qy';
update content_bodies set title = 'Autumn Foliage at Tokachidake Onsen in 2019', description = 'Tokachidake Onsen is known for being one of the earliest places in Hokkaido to witness autumn foliage. This summary captures the beautiful autumn colors of the Tokachidake Onsen area on a perfectly clear day in 2019.' where id = 'G1Nrz-3fyvLP4tz0sX3h1';
update content_bodies set title = 'フラワーランドかみふらの花火オンライン2020', description = 'このイベントは、YouTubeライブによる特別なWEB中継として行われます。日時は令和2年8月29日（土）19：30からです。会場はフラワーランドかみふらので、主催は一般社団法人かみふらの十勝岳観光協会です。後援・協力には上富良野町とフラワーランドかみふらのが含まれています。' where id = 'ztKn0r4IJ4CffLZvyzixK';
update content_bodies set title = 'FLOWERLAND KAMIFURANO FIREWORKS ONLINE 2020', description = 'The event will be a special online broadcast via YouTube live. It is scheduled for August 29, 2020, starting at 19:30. The venue for the fireworks display is Flowerland Kamifurano. The event is organized by the Kamifurano Tokachidake Tourism Association, with support and cooperation from Kamifurano Town and Flowerland Kamifurano.' where id = '1yYkhzbg4SPCkYqCLgNXy';
update content_bodies set title = '十勝岳スカイラインルート開通式', description = '道道十勝岳温泉美瑛線、通称「十勝岳スカイライン」が、今年もゴールデンウィーク前に、半年振りに十勝岳温泉と白金温泉間が通行可能となります。開通式は平成30年4月27日（金）午前11:00から行われ、観光協会会長や来賓を招いてテープカットが行われます。上富良野側でお待ちの方には記念品がプレゼントされます。また、昨年同様にゲート解放後にはサイクリングパレードも行われます。この機会にぜひ、残雪の十勝岳スカイラインを走行してみてください。' where id = 'TDzuge3F0wcVcA20NlCtu';
update content_bodies set title = 'Tokachidake Skyline Route Opening Ceremony', description = 'The Tokachidake Skyline, officially known as the Dōdō Tokachidake Onsen Biei Line, will open for traffic between Tokachidake Onsen and Shirogane Onsen just before Golden Week, after being closed for six months. The opening ceremony will take place on April 27, 2018, at 11:00 AM, with the attendance of the tourism association president and other guests for a ribbon-cutting event. Attendees waiting from the Kamifurano side will receive commemorative gifts. Similar to last year, a cycling parade will be held after the gate opens. This is a great opportunity to experience the snow-covered Tokachidake Skyline.' where id = 'AZAMFs1GH_8KpBBTZSb53';
update content_bodies set title = '北広島町にも『むすびのむさし』があるって知ってましたか？', description = '北広島町には『むすびのむさし』があり、広島県民に愛されている人気の「若鶏むすび」弁当が楽しめます。広島県内には15店舗あり、その一つが北広島町の道の駅豊平どんぐり村にあります。この道の駅ではスポーツや蕎麦打ち、温泉など一日中楽しむことができ、広島駅から車で約1時間の距離にあります。自然に囲まれた場所で、近くの龍頭山の頂上でお弁当を食べるのもおすすめです。山頂駐車場から徒歩約15分で頂上に到達できるため、登山が苦手な方でも楽しめます。北広島町に訪れた際には、ぜひ『むすびのむさし』を味わってみてください。' where id = '9D7TnerRus9_feZLBy-wz';
update content_bodies set title = 'Did you know there is ''Musubi no Musashi'' in Kitahiroshima Town?', description = 'Did you know that ''Musubi no Musashi'' is located in Kitahiroshima Town? The Musashi Donguri Village Toyohira store is a popular spot among Hiroshima residents, known for its beloved ''Wakadori Musubi'' bento, which is always a comforting taste. There are 15 Musashi locations in Hiroshima Prefecture, including one in Kitahiroshima Town. The Toyohira Donguri Village roadside station offers various activities such as sports, soba making, and hot springs, making it a great place to spend the day. It''s about an hour''s drive from Hiroshima Station, perfect for a leisurely trip surrounded by nature. Enjoying a bento at the top of Ryutozan is also recommended, as it''s a 15-minute walk from the parking area to the summit, making it accessible for those who may find a strenuous hike challenging. If you visit Kitahiroshima Town, be sure to stop by and try Musubi no Musashi!' where id = '0Sbzx9fOFMShDXYAQOiIN';
update content_bodies set title = '【リピーター続出】贅沢スイーツを食べにレッツらもー‼ #北広島町', description = '広島北ホテルで週末限定のシャーベットフェアが開催され、リピーターが続出しています。このホテルは天然ラドン温泉を日帰りで楽しめ、ペットOKの部屋もあり、アクセスも良好です。シャーベットフェアでは、数量限定の「まるごとメロンシャーベット」（2,400円）と新メニューの「しろくま風シャーベット」（1,200円）が提供されます。前者はメロンと濃厚チーズ生クリームの組み合わせ、後者は8種のフルーツと自家製ヨーグルトアイスのハーモニーが楽しめます。開催期間は2025年6月28日から8月3日までの土日祝で、数量限定のため予約をおすすめします。' where id = 'Gr2hL9Ugqy4sWGYn4EI0Y';
update content_bodies set title = 'Repeat Visitors Galore: Let''s Go for Luxurious Sweets! #KitaHiroshimaTown', description = 'The Hiroshima Kita Hotel, located in Kita Hiroshima Town, is hosting a popular weekend-only Sherbet Fair, attracting many repeat visitors. This hotel offers day-use access to natural radon hot springs and pet-friendly rooms, making it easily accessible from various locations. The Sherbet Fair features two exclusive items: the ''Whole Melon Sherbet'' priced at 2,400 yen (tax included) for 1-2 servings, which combines refreshing melon sherbet with rich cheese cream, and the new ''Shirokuma-style Sherbet'' at 1,200 yen per serving, made with eight types of fruit and creamy yogurt ice. The event runs from June 28 to August 3, 2025, on weekends only, with limited quantities available. Reservations are recommended, and inquiries can be made through the hotel''s Instagram. Don''t miss out on these summer sweets!' where id = 'QNd5IMTvxqeCqzJc3HgOT';
update content_bodies set title = '令和7年7月7日(月)は七夕🎋✨️ #北広島町', description = '令和7年7月7日(月)は七夕が祝われます。観光協会は道の駅舞ロードIC千代田の観光案内所前に七夕飾りを設置しました。風に揺れる笹と短冊が趣を醸し出しています。皆様の願いが叶いますように。短冊は観光案内所に用意されていますので、ぜひ自由に願いを書いてください。' where id = 'kiwGcq64c0MqWXX84pfGa';
update content_bodies set title = 'Tanabata on July 7, 2025 🎋✨️ #KitaHiroshimaTown', description = 'On July 7, 2025, Tanabata will be celebrated. The tourism association has set up Tanabata decorations in front of the tourist information center located at the Michi no Eki Mai Road IC Chiyoda. The bamboo and tanzaku (wish strips) sway gently in the wind, creating a charming atmosphere. We hope your wishes come true. Tanzaku are available at the tourist information center, so please feel free to write your wishes.' where id = 'UUWQ4hJ_ZRdMdD5cZWqbU';
update content_bodies set title = '田舎の夏', description = '『Blue Art Guesthouse』が広島に近日オープン予定です。田舎の風景の中で特別な体験ができる場所となるでしょう。' where id = 'a3T3j6HLawTC_T4Ak2IL3';
update content_bodies set title = 'Summer in the Countryside', description = 'The ''Blue Art Guesthouse'' is coming soon in Hiroshima, promising a unique experience in a rural setting.' where id = 'FjbVW7PU5KIAUgz6PoFSL';
update content_bodies set title = '宮島夜市「宮島つき祭り」開催', description = '3月8日と9日の2日間、宮島夜市「宮島つき祭り」が開催され、今年で3回目となりました。北広島町も参加し、「へんぽこ茶屋」が出店。焼肉の香ばしい香りに誘われたお客さんが絶えず、自家製の保存料不使用のもち米で作ったお餅が好評でした。海外からの訪問者もいちご大福を楽しんでいました。神楽の演目も盛況で、山王神楽団が出演し、観客を魅了しました。観光PRステージでは、観光大使の月山翔雲さんが会場を盛り上げ、2日目には広島県立廿日市西高等学校のダンス部が華やかさを加えました。北広島町の観光ブースではSNSフォロワーにノベルティをプレゼントし、来場者からの応援もありました。大盛況の祭りで、来年もぜひお越しください。' where id = 'FQ1COfT5bwheUSSxAWmyM';
update content_bodies set title = 'Miyajima Night Market ''Miyajima Tsuki Festival'' Held', description = 'The ''Miyajima Tsuki Festival'' took place on March 8th and 9th, marking its third year. North Hiroshima Town participated with a booth from ''Henpoko Chaya,'' attracting customers with the enticing aroma of grilled meat. Their homemade rice cakes, made without preservatives, were freshly made and chewy, delighting visitors, including international guests enjoying strawberry daifuku. The traditional Kagura performances by the Sanno Kagura Group captivated the audience. The event also featured a tourism PR stage, with guest appearances from tourism ambassador Tsukiyama Sho-un and the dance club from Hiroshima Prefectural Hatsukaichi Nishi High School, adding vibrancy to the festival. North Hiroshima Town''s tourism booth offered novelties to those who followed their social media. The festival was a great success, filled with laughter and applause, and organizers hope to see everyone again next year.' where id = 'kFsAalSEDIdhShZjzNuFy';
update content_bodies set title = '春色、くるくる：ひな祭りシフォンロールはいかが？🌸 #北広島町', description = '絶品プリンやふわっふわシフォンケーキで知られる「にわのにわとり」が、ひな祭りにぴったりの可愛いシフォンケーキを販売します。春色のロールケーキは、いちごをたっぷり使い、クリームとの相性が抜群です。試行錯誤の末に理想の生地とクリームにたどり着き、ふわふわの生地は軽やかで、クリームの甘さと共に溶けていきます。あっという間に完食できる美味しさです。横山さんの笑顔も魅力的です。3月2日、3日の予約販売限定で、予約は2月27日（木）まで受け付けています。特別なロールケーキをぜひお祝いのテーブルにどうぞ。12cmで税込2000円です。予約はDMまたは店頭で受け付け中です。' where id = 'OsVhqoXd4Jk5dlh3QtFRu';
update content_bodies set title = 'Spring Colors, Twirling: How about a Hina Matsuri Chiffon Roll? 🌸 #Kitahiroshima', description = 'The well-known ''Niwa no Niwatori'' is offering an adorable chiffon cake just in time for Hina Matsuri. This delightful spring-colored roll cake is made with plenty of strawberries, perfectly complemented by rich cream and the tartness of the strawberries. After much trial and error, they have finally achieved the ideal texture for both the cake and cream. The fluffy cake feels weightless, melting in your mouth alongside the sweetness of the cream. It''s so delicious that you''ll finish it in no time! The cheerful smile of Mr. Yokoyama from ''Niwa no Niwatori'' adds to the experience. This special chiffon roll is available for pre-order only on March 2nd and 3rd, perfect for Hina Matsuri celebrations. Orders can be placed until February 27th (Thursday) for a price of 2000 yen (tax included) for a 12cm roll. Reservations can be made via DM or in-store!' where id = 'nkISQFBvKdAqn26VrzjWH';
update content_bodies set title = '謎の三角形出現！？町内のスキー場、やわたハイランド191リゾートさんへ観光協会職員が調査に行ってきました', description = '町内のスキー場、やわたハイランド191リゾートに謎の三角形が出現し、観光協会の職員が調査に訪れました。この三角形は人工造雪機で作られた人工雪の山でした。オープンに向けて準備や点検が進められています。特別に雪を楽しむ機会があり、福本さんと一緒に雪でハートを作ったり滑ったりしました。福本さんは191リゾートのYouTubeを運営しており、動画撮影やアドバイスをしてくれました。滑った後の福本さんの表情がとても面白く、この動画でファンが増えたことでしょう。北広島町には3つのスキー場があり、やわたハイランド191リゾートは12月20日にオープン予定です。ユートピアサイオトは12月中旬にオープン予定で、芸北高原大佐スキー場は100%天然雪のゲレンデです。スキーシーズンがやってきます！' where id = 'RrhdPSNGjhxmEgcTmY3FH';
update content_bodies set title = 'Mysterious Triangle Appears!? Investigation by Local Tourism Association Staff at Yahata Highland 191 Resort', description = 'A mysterious triangle has appeared at the local ski resort, Yahata Highland 191 Resort, which was investigated by staff from the tourism association. The triangle is actually a mound of artificial snow created by a snow-making machine. Preparations and inspections are underway for the upcoming opening. The staff had a special early experience of the snow, creating a heart shape and skiing with Mr. Fukumoto from the resort. Mr. Fukumoto runs the resort''s YouTube channel, providing tips for filming and making the video enjoyable. After skiing together, the staff found Mr. Fukumoto''s expressions amusing. This video is likely to attract more fans to Mr. Fukumoto. The ski season is approaching, with three ski resorts in Kitahiroshima Town: Yahata Highland 191 Resort opening on December 20, Utopia Saioto preparing to open in mid-December, and Geihoku Kogen Osa Ski Resort with 100% natural snow. Stay tuned for the opening video!' where id = 'Dj91n2f1w-c4_BQUZJqEw';
update content_bodies set title = '北広島町の風景～紫の里～', description = 'ふりかけの大エース『ゆかり®︎』で知られる三島食品のルーツが北広島町にあることをご存知ですか？昭和24年に創業した三島哲男さんは北広島町有田の出身で、彼の生家は現在『楠苑』というふりかけの資料館になっています。楠苑の前には自社農園『紫の里』があり、赤シソ畑が広がっています。北広島町では5月中旬からシソ色のじゅうたんが広がり、今だけの美しい景色が楽しめます。撮影は2023年6月13日です。' where id = 'efwqL10SZqp8WK1kNGTC4';
update content_bodies set title = 'Scenery of Kitahiroshima Town - The Purple Village', description = 'Did you know that the roots of Mishima Foods, famous for its furikake ''Yukari®'', are in Kitahiroshima Town? Founded in 1949 by Tetsuo Mishima, who hails from Arita in Kitahiroshima, the connection to Yukari® is deep. The birthplace of Tetsuo Mishima is now the ''Kusunoki-en'' furikake museum, showcasing the history and production of furikake. In front of the museum lies a vast field of red shiso, part of their own farm ''The Purple Village'' located in Kitahiroshima. From mid-May, the town is covered in a carpet of shiso, creating a unique seasonal landscape. The photo was taken on June 13, 2023.' where id = 'xYJjQ-Hb0mJ9HOeENpO7W';
update content_bodies set title = 'この町は、冬の楽しみ方を知っている。', description = '北広島町の映像制作会社うえひろやスタジオと観光協会が共同で「冬の北広島町」をPRする動画を制作しました。短編と長編があり、短編は気軽に楽しめるポップなテイストで、長編にはないシーンも多く含まれています。長編は、スランプに陥った女性画家が冬の北広島町を訪れ、冬ならではのアクティビティや絶景に触れることで心が動かされ、再び絵を描けるようになるかを描いたドラマ風の内容です。爽快な音楽と共に彼女の心境の変化と美しい冬の景観が楽しめます。このプロジェクトは、北広島町観光協会が企画・制作し、撮影・編集はうえひろやスタジオが担当しました。制作期間は2022年12月から2023年3月までです。' where id = 'ink4hpHxixpM0gvpv8hcj';
update content_bodies set title = 'This Town Knows How to Enjoy Winter', description = 'A video project promoting ''Winter in Kitahiroshima Town'' has been created by the local video production company Uehiroya Studio and the tourism association. The project includes both short and long versions, with the shorts designed to be light and easy to watch, featuring many scenes not included in the long version. The long version presents a dramatic narrative centered around a female painter experiencing a creative slump. She receives a message that prompts her to visit Kitahiroshima Town in winter. Despite her initial anxiety, she becomes inspired by the unique winter activities and breathtaking scenery. The video highlights her emotional journey alongside the beautiful winter landscapes, accompanied by refreshing music. The project was planned and produced by the Kitahiroshima Town Tourism Association, with filming and editing by Uehiroya Studio, from December 2022 to March 2023.' where id = 'j83Hwcrsi9xK4fQmUTPOg';
update content_bodies set title = '県立広島大学の大学祭「紫苑祭」に行ってきました！！ #北広島町#旅行 　#大学　#観光', description = '県立広島大学の大学祭「紫苑祭」に参加しました。ブースでは町内のスキー場のリフト券やカープグッズが当たるガラポン抽選会が行われ、多くの方が参加しました。スキー場のリフト券を当てた生徒さんの喜ぶ姿が印象的でした。ステージでは北広島町の伝統芸能やスキー場情報をPRし、景品付きのクイズ大会も開催しました。真剣に考える生徒たちがとてもかわいかったです。「おいでよ！キタひろ」ダンスでは多くの生徒が参加し、盛り上がりました。腕相撲大会にも参加し、優勝者にあっさり負けて悔しがりました。チュロスや肉巻きおにぎりの出店、お化け屋敷やカジノなど、大学祭らしい青春の場で観光PRができて嬉しかったです。今年の冬もぜひ北広島町のスキー場に遊びに来てください。' where id = 'utZNsPtpDj19p3EJ3OwYx';
update content_bodies set title = 'I Attended the Prefectural Hiroshima University Festival ''Shion Festival''!! #KitahiroshimaTown #Travel #University #Tourism', description = 'I participated in the ''Shion Festival'' at Prefectural Hiroshima University. There was a raffle with prizes like lift tickets to local ski resorts and Carp merchandise, which attracted many participants. It was heartwarming to see students joyfully winning ski lift tickets. During the stage event, I promoted tourism by discussing traditional arts and ski resort information in Kitahiroshima Town, followed by a quiz competition with prizes. The students were adorable as they seriously pondered the quiz questions. The ''Oideyo! Kita Hiro'' dance was a hit, with many students joining in and energetically cheering. I unexpectedly took part in an arm wrestling competition against the champion, but I lost quickly, much to my disappointment. The festival featured delicious food stalls like churros and meat-wrapped rice balls, as well as attractions like a haunted house and casino, embodying the spirit of a university festival. I am very happy to have promoted tourism in such a vibrant setting. I hope everyone visits the ski resort in Kitahiroshima Town this winter!' where id = '-MbvhJdfNUxlLI3oJ6ffi';
update content_bodies set title = 'この町は、冬の楽しみ方を知っている。', description = '北広島町の映像制作会社うえひろやスタジオと観光協会が協力し、「冬の北広島町」をPRする動画を制作しました。テーマは「冬の北広島町には、描きたくなる景色がある。」で、短編と長編の2種類があります。短編（short01～short03）は気軽に楽しめるポップな内容で、長編にはないシーンも多く含まれています。長編は、スランプに陥った画家の女性が冬の北広島町を訪れ、冬ならではのアクティビティや絶景に触れ、心が動かされる様子を描いたドラマ風の動画です。爽快な音楽と共に彼女の心境の変化と美しい冬の景観が楽しめます。制作は2022年12月から2023年3月にかけて行われました。' where id = 'F9fyd1_vZxLIcOEBmsQtW';
update content_bodies set title = 'This Town Knows How to Enjoy Winter', description = 'A video project promoting ''Winter in Kitahiroshima Town'' has been created by the local video production company Uehiroya Studio and the tourism association. The theme highlights the picturesque winter scenery that inspires creativity. The project includes both short and long versions of the video. The short versions (short01 to short03) are designed to be light-hearted and easy to watch, featuring scenes not included in the long version. The long version presents a dramatic narrative about a female painter experiencing a creative slump who finds inspiration in the winter activities and breathtaking landscapes of Kitahiroshima Town. Accompanied by uplifting music, the video captures her emotional journey and the stunning winter scenery. The project was developed from December 2022 to March 2023.' where id = 'TCbanHT8C9HWGAHNdKRIQ';
update content_bodies set title = '開店20周年を迎えた「四季乃家 彩蔵」さんに花田舞太郎と観光協会職員がお昼ご飯を食べに行ってきました', description = '「四季乃家 彩蔵」はこの8月で開店20周年を迎え、花田舞太郎さんと観光協会職員が訪れました。玄関には季節のひまわりが飾られ、洗練された和の空間が広がっています。今回は10食限定の蕎麦ランチを楽しみ、旬の食材を使った料理は美味しさが際立ちます。特にとうもろこしご飯は甘さが口いっぱいに広がり、季節のエネルギーを感じました。完全予約制で20年続いている理由を大将がユーモアを交えて語り、来店することでその魅力がわかると伝えています。大切な人との特別な時間を「四季乃家 彩蔵」で過ごすことをおすすめします。' where id = 'DfLZmgYKDBPD_JAr-RSb5';
update content_bodies set title = 'Celebrating 20 Years of ''Shikinoya Ayakura'' with a Lunch Visit from Maitaro Hanada and Local Tourism Staff', description = 'Maitaro Hanada and local tourism staff visited ''Shikinoya Ayakura'' to celebrate its 20th anniversary. Upon entering, they were greeted by seasonal sunflowers. The restaurant''s interior blends refined beauty with a relaxing ''wa'' (Japanese) atmosphere, showcasing the owner''s exquisite taste. They enjoyed a limited 10-set soba lunch featuring seasonal ingredients selected by the chef, which was both beautiful and delicious. The sweet corn rice was particularly delightful, filling them with energy from the seasonal produce. ''Shikinoya Ayakura'' has been thriving for 20 years as a reservation-only establishment, with the chef playfully inviting guests to discover the reasons for its popularity. Visitors are encouraged to spend special moments with loved ones at this charming restaurant. For more details on the soba lunch, check their social media. The restaurant is located in Hiroshima Prefecture and operates with specific hours and reservation requirements.' where id = 'BFOa3C6np4Axenz2VYIX2';
update content_bodies set title = '北広島町のスキー場「ユートピアサイオト」の夏のアクティビティをご紹介', description = 'この記事では、北広島町にあるユートピアサイオトスキー場の夏のアクティビティを紹介しています。この夏は、自分の殻を破って様々なアクティビティを楽しむことをお勧めします。詳細は、説明文にリンクされたフルバージョンをご覧ください。営業日は公式ウェブサイトで確認できます。ユートピアサイオトの住所は、広島県山県郡北広島町才乙144、郵便番号731-2314です。予約は0826-35-1234まで、受付時間は8:30から17:00までです。' where id = '4gNC39U-dTc_qM3yu1amf';
update content_bodies set title = 'Summer Activities at Utopia Saioto Ski Resort in Kitahiroshima Town', description = 'This article introduces the summer activities available at Utopia Saioto Ski Resort in Kitahiroshima Town. Visitors are encouraged to break out of their shells and enjoy the various offerings this summer. For more details, check the full version linked in the description. The resort''s operating days can be found on their website. Utopia Saioto is located at 144 Saioto, Kitahiroshima Town, Hiroshima Prefecture, 731-2314. For reservations, call 0826-35-1234 during the hours of 8:30 AM to 5:00 PM.' where id = 'TYc1GHaGPU08ZGGmmaIi8';
update content_bodies set title = '北広島町のスキー場「ユートピアサイオト」の期間限定「夏のアクティビティ」を舞太郎と観光協会職員が体験してきました！！', description = '北広島町のスキー場「ユートピアサイオト」で、舞太郎と観光協会職員が期間限定の夏のアクティビティを体験しました。体験したのは、木々の間に張られたロープを滑り降りる「ジップライン」と、ゲレンデや林道を駆け巡る「バギーアドベンチャー」の2つです。ジップラインでは、高さにビビりながらも風を感じる爽快感を楽しみ、次回は全6コースを制覇する意気込みを見せました。一方、バギーアドベンチャーでは、支配人の山元さんに必死についていきながら、人気コース「天空バギーアドベンチャー」を楽しみました。標高1,000mからの絶景を堪能し、大自然のパワーを感じる達成感を味わいました。この夏はぜひユートピアサイオトで自分の殻を破ってみてください。' where id = 'vCldQmtFnMkkGvbk2n4w4';
update content_bodies set title = 'Experience Summer Activities at Utopia Saioto Ski Resort in Kitahiroshima Town!', description = 'At the Utopia Saioto Ski Resort in Kitahiroshima Town, a limited-time summer activity was experienced by Maitaro and a tourism association staff member. They tried two activities: the zip line, which involves sliding down a rope stretched between trees, and the buggy adventure, which takes you through the slopes and forest roads. The staff member, who is not fond of heights, hesitated at the zip line''s starting point but eventually enjoyed the exhilarating feeling of flying through the air. With six courses available, they plan to conquer them all next time. The buggy adventure was even more thrilling, as they followed the manager, Yamamoto, on the popular ''Sky Buggy Adventure'' course, which spans 4,000 meters and climbs to an elevation of 1,000 meters, offering breathtaking views of the Sea of Japan. This summer, they encourage everyone to break out of their shells at Utopia Saioto.' where id = 'HU8GYWrG2cPVubP9xRvaY';
update content_bodies set title = 'ふけかけの工場見学に行ってみた。', description = '先日、ふりかけ『ゆかり®︎』で知られる三島食品の工場見学をしました。三島食品のルーツは北広島町にあり、創業者の三島哲男さんはこの町の出身です。彼の生家は現在『楠苑』というふりかけの資料館になっており、全国のふりかけメーカーの商品や製造工程を学ぶことができます。また、三島食品は自社農園『紫の里』を持ち、赤シソを栽培しています。北広島町では5月中旬からシソ色のじゅうたんが広がり、特別な景色が楽しめます。撮影は2023年6月13日です。' where id = '3pGIyX9wYwet-vfEb-BwH';
update content_bodies set title = 'Factory Tour of Furikake', description = 'Recently, I had the opportunity to visit a factory! Did you know that the roots of Mishima Foods, famous for its furikake ''Yukari®'', are in Kitahiroshima Town? The founder, Tetsuo Mishima, hails from this area, and his family home is now the Kusunoki-en, a museum dedicated to furikake. The museum showcases various furikake products and educates visitors about their origins and manufacturing processes. Additionally, Mishima Foods has its own farm, ''Murasaki no Sato'', where red shiso is cultivated. From mid-May, the fields around Kitahiroshima Town are covered in a beautiful carpet of shiso, creating a unique seasonal landscape. The photos were taken on June 13, 2023.' where id = 'L2yypgKoBxN9boASdAhmU';
update content_bodies set title = '夏の雲月山が心地よかった～ハイキング感覚で楽しめる草原の山～', description = '標高911.2mの雲月山は、春に山焼きが行われる草原の山で、中国山地に数少ない存在です。ハイキングやトレッキングを楽しむ人々に人気があり、晴れた日には日本海まで見渡せる絶景が広がります。撮影日は2022年8月3日です。' where id = 'OHOfcPMloFnozK7n47pz8';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kumozuki Mountain: A Pleasant Experience in Summer – Enjoyable as a Hiking Destination', description = 'Kumozuki Mountain, standing at an elevation of 911.2 meters, is known for its grassland and is one of the few such mountains in the Chugoku region. The mountain is popular for hiking and trekking, especially during the spring when a traditional mountain burning event takes place. On clear days, visitors can enjoy a panoramic view extending to the Sea of Japan. The photo was taken on August 3, 2022.' where id = '7nRKrDqDwgjm_q7hG890B';
update content_bodies set title = '壬生城址のツツジ', description = '4月11日現在、壬生城址のツツジが見頃を迎えています。道の駅舞ロードIC千代田からも近く、ちょっとしたハイキング気分で訪れるのに最適です（道の駅から車で5分、駐車場から徒歩10分）。この場所からは地域を一望できるため、眺めも最高です！' where id = 'hrq_HGR_FqqMKGoS6-ek-';
update content_bodies set title = 'Azaleas at Mibu Castle Ruins', description = 'As of April 11, the azaleas at Mibu Castle Ruins are in full bloom. It''s a great opportunity to visit for a short hike, as it''s close to the Michi no Eki Mai Road IC Chiyoda (just a 5-minute drive and a 10-minute walk from the parking lot). The view from the site offers a fantastic panorama of the surrounding area!' where id = 'b6vwVPcpMidTWz18wR_Y7';
update content_bodies set title = '2022桜サイクリングin北広島町', description = '2022年4月5日現在、千代田地域の桜が見ごろを迎えています。道の駅を訪れ、レンタサイクルで桜巡りを楽しんでみてはいかがでしょうか。うららかな陽気と絶景が待っています。撮影日は2022年4月5日で、場所は道の駅舞ロードIC千代田周辺（広島県山県郡北広島町有田1122）です。BGMは魔王魂によるものです。北広島町観光協会のホームページや、ガイドツアーを行っているO.M.S大朝モビリティステーションの情報もぜひご覧ください。' where id = 'hiyapNEJ7JqAMVkOVyZgj';
update content_bodies set title = '2022 Cherry Blossom Cycling in Kitahiroshima Town', description = 'As of April 5, 2022, the cherry blossoms in the Chiyoda area are in full bloom. Why not visit the roadside station and explore the cherry blossoms by renting a bicycle? Pleasant weather and stunning views await you! The shooting date was April 5, 2022, at the roadside station Mai Road IC Chiyoda, located at 1122 Arita, Kitahiroshima Town, Yamagata District, Hiroshima Prefecture. Background music is provided by Maou Damashii. For more information, visit the Kitahiroshima Town Tourism Association website and O.M.S. Oasa Mobility Station, which offers guided tours.' where id = 'kQCEQYpyzrf5UqKvTHaTc';
update content_bodies set title = 'どん北をよろしくお願います！', description = '北広島町を拠点に活動する地域密着型ソフトテニスクラブ「どんぐり北広島」（どん北）の紹介動画です。どん北の選手たちがYouTuberに扮し、ソフトテニスの魅力や地域とのつながりを楽しく伝えています。笑いと感動が詰まったこの動画では、選手の素顔やアスリートとしての姿、地元の人々との交流が描かれています。' where id = 'mASwX75JT25WdZqBuc3UA';
update content_bodies set title = 'Please Support Don Kita!', description = 'This is an introduction video for ''Donguri Kitahiroshima'' (Don Kita), a community-oriented soft tennis club based in Kitahiroshima Town. The players of Don Kita take on the role of YouTubers to convey the charm of soft tennis and their community involvement in a fun way. The video showcases laughter and emotion, revealing the athletes'' true selves, their dedication as sportspeople, and their interactions with local residents.' where id = 'JTbEMhVBy7Q74kAvos5Mh';
update content_bodies set title = 'きたひろスケッチ⑥ 「亀山八幡神社」', description = '「きたひろスケッチ」は、北広島町観光協会の職員2人が町内の観光スポットをスケッチする企画です。芸大出身で休日にはアート制作に励む島田さんと、絵を描くのが好きな日下さんが担当しています。今回は第6回目で、「亀山八幡神社」を描きます。この動画は地元ケーブルテレビ「きたひろネット」で放送されたもののアーカイブで、より多くの方に見てもらうためにYouTubeにアップされました。' where id = 'mitXA0K-T9hXa5RZn10of';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kitahiro Sketch #6: Kameyama Hachiman Shrine', description = 'The ''Kitahiro Sketch'' project, initiated by two staff members of the Kitahiroshima Town Tourism Association, involves sketching various local spots as a new form of tourism. The artists, Shimada, a graduate of an art university who engages in various art projects during weekends, and Kusaka, who enjoys drawing, are responsible for this initiative. In this sixth installment, they will sketch the Kameyama Hachiman Shrine. This video is an archive of a broadcast from the local cable television ''Kitahiro Net'' and has been uploaded to YouTube to reach a wider audience.' where id = 'vOLbs1deGWXrJASMIxNPe';
update content_bodies set title = '【北広島町】JB北広島乗馬クラブ', description = '中国自動車道千代田ICから車で10分の場所に位置するJB北広島乗馬クラブは、広島県内外の乗馬ファンを歓迎しています。多くの人が馬に乗って草原を駆け抜ける姿に憧れを抱いており、馬上からの素晴らしい景色は、実際に体験した人にしか分からない喜びです。広がりを感じることで、世界の見え方が変わることもあります。また、馬とのふれあいは特別な安らぎをもたらします。緑豊かな自然に囲まれたJB北広島乗馬クラブは、あなたの夢を実現するお手伝いをします。' where id = 'Y3sy0We5qZKSKASeydG4X';
update content_bodies set title = 'JB Kitahiroshima Riding Club', description = 'Located just 10 minutes from the Chiyoda IC on the Chugoku Expressway, JB Kitahiroshima Riding Club welcomes horse riding enthusiasts from both Hiroshima Prefecture and beyond. Many people dream of galloping across the grasslands on horseback, and the joy of experiencing the breathtaking views from atop a horse is something only those who have tried it can truly understand. The expansive scenery can change your perspective on the world. Additionally, interacting with horses provides a unique sense of tranquility. Surrounded by lush nature, JB Kitahiroshima Riding Club is here to help you realize your dreams.' where id = 'c5xFYoNArAv1uemlIvs4H';
update content_bodies set title = '【北広島町】打ち上げ花火ライブ配信（2020.8.1）', description = '8月1日に予定されていた本地夏祭りは、新型コロナウイルスの影響で中止となりました。しかし、本地地区の住民有志で構成される本地・赤鬼会が、約70発の花火を密を避けるためにシークレットな場所で打ち上げました。当日はその様子をライブ配信し、編集した動画が公開されています。本地・赤鬼会の想いが伝わることを願っています。' where id = 'x0YFI6FOaD-D1q69Zn9Q8';
update content_bodies set title = 'Live Streaming of Fireworks in Kitahiroshima Town (August 1, 2020)', description = 'The local summer festival was scheduled for August 1, but it was canceled due to the impact of the COVID-19 pandemic. However, a group of local residents known as the Honchi Akoni Association decided to launch about 70 fireworks in a secret location to prevent crowding. The event was live-streamed, and an edited video of the fireworks display has been made available. It is hoped that the feelings of the Honchi Akoni Association can be conveyed through this video.' where id = 'BdVz4qLFq83eRTCtY_HPE';
update content_bodies set title = '【花田舞太郎】最後の戦い...！ゆるキャラグランプリ応援動画', description = '今年で最後となる『ゆるキャラ®︎グランプリ』に、北広島町のイメージキャラクター「花田舞太郎」がエントリーしています。地域の皆さんからは温かい応援メッセージが寄せられています。ぜひ応援をよろしくお願いします！' where id = 'xoV8doVT_b9GYylILv270';
update content_bodies set title = 'Final Battle of Muitaro Hanada...! Support Video for Yuru-Chara Grand Prix', description = 'This year marks the final Yuru-Chara Grand Prix, and Muitaro Hanada, the mascot character of Kitahiroshima Town, is participating! The local community has shared warm messages of support. If you can, please cheer for us!' where id = 'cNHXM3QLzakq6AD59tgpS';
update content_bodies set title = '花田舞太郎 夏のアクティビティに挑戦！', description = '『鳥になって空を飛んでみたい！』という願いを叶える体験型アトラクションがユートピアサイオトで楽しめます。私は初めてZIPLINEとスカイウォークに挑戦し、素晴らしい体験をしました。冬はウインタースポーツが楽しめ、夏は自然を満喫できるアトラクションが揃っています。詳しくはホームページをご覧ください。' where id = 'HI9gQqWRvBPRd2R-YXf5q';
update content_bodies set title = 'Challenging Summer Activities with Maitaro Hanada!', description = 'Experience the thrill of flying like a bird with a new attraction at Utopia Saioto! This summer, I tried ziplining and skywalking for the first time, and it was an exhilarating experience. While winter offers exciting winter sports, summer is perfect for enjoying nature through these attractions at Utopia Saioto. For more details, visit the website!' where id = 'EzsonYUiWHixl637-LKsu';
update content_bodies set title = 'レイザーラモンRGの出水旅！ショートver.', description = '吉本興業に所属するお笑い芸人のレイザーラモンRGさんが、鹿児島県出水市の魅力を紹介します。出水市の特性や観光スポット、地元の文化などを通じて、観光客にとっての魅力を伝える内容となっています。' where id = 'wWcsinQb14vP3SkXXLYSW';
update content_bodies set title = 'Razor Ramon RG''s Trip to Izumi! Short Version', description = 'Razor Ramon RG, a comedian affiliated with Yoshimoto Kogyo, introduces the charm of Izumi City in Kagoshima Prefecture!' where id = '8ESUTwfnTggIJZQCYD_q-';
update content_bodies set title = '鹿児島県出水市のあるあるって何だと思います？', description = '地元の人々も悩むこの問題に、吉本興業の芸人レイザーラモンRGさんが一石を投じるという内容です。' where id = 'b2VbBLQ9zhSxML_GIDx-2';
update content_bodies set title = 'What are the common issues in Izumi City, Kagoshima Prefecture?', description = 'Local residents are troubled by this issue, and comedian RG from Yoshimoto Kogyo is stepping in to address it!' where id = 'JydjjPYKdFxmB0S0ig58l';
update content_bodies set title = '住む人と土地の温もりに間近で触れる。鹿児島県・出水市で農泊体験', description = '鹿児島と熊本の県境に位置する出水市は、日本一のツルの渡来地として知られています。この町には、江戸時代の武家屋敷群や日本一の大鈴を供える神社など、見どころが豊富です。出水市の魅力を深く知るためには、「農泊」という宿泊スタイルが最適です。農山漁村地域に滞在することで、その地域の生活を体験できるのが農泊の魅力です。出水市の暮らしを身近に感じ、大自然に触れ、独自の食文化を知ることができます。これらの体験を凝縮した1泊2日の旅に出かけてみましょう。' where id = 'jyRTXb7FDx_jBY_pGFJ_c';
update content_bodies set title = 'Experience the Warmth of People and Land: Agricultural Stay in Izumi City, Kagoshima Prefecture', description = 'Izumi City, located on the border of Kagoshima and Kumamoto, is renowned as Japan''s top destination for migratory cranes. The city features many attractions, including samurai residences from the Edo period and a shrine housing the largest bell in Japan. To truly appreciate the charm of Izumi City, an ''agricultural stay'' is highly recommended. This accommodation style allows visitors to immerse themselves in the local lifestyle by staying in rural areas. Experience the close-knit community, the beauty of nature, and the unique food culture of Izumi City. Embark on a condensed 1-night, 2-day journey that encapsulates all these experiences.' where id = '_yggphzqX5PjnKyPo7Sqo';
update content_bodies set title = 'I love Izumi!!　鹿児島県出水市 4K動画', description = '鹿児島県出水市は「日本一のツルの飛来地」として知られ、他にも多くの日本一があります。出水ナビでは、ツルの飛来数に関する最新情報や、出水市でのおすすめの過ごし方を紹介しています。出水市観光情報サイト「出水ナビ」では、観光に役立つ情報が満載です。' where id = 'lmdESVaJihbf_Nyrd7tZ-';
update content_bodies set title = 'I love Izumi!! 4K Video from Izumi City, Kagoshima Prefecture', description = 'Izumi City in Kagoshima Prefecture is known for being home to the largest number of cranes in Japan, among other notable features. The Izumi Navi website provides the latest information on crane arrivals and recommendations for enjoying your time in the city.' where id = '8neD5IH_NdjFkxKqpniBz';
update content_bodies set title = '出雲周遊観光タクシー「うさぎ号」プロモーション動画(short.ver)', description = '出雲市内の名所を巡る「出雲周遊観光タクシー うさぎ号」では、タクシー1台に1人のガイドが同行し、各スポットの歴史や由緒、見どころをわかりやすく説明します。コロナ渦の中で密を避け、安全に出雲の魅力を楽しむことができる小回りのきく旅を提供します。詳しくは出雲観光協会のホームページをご覧ください。' where id = 'nzj_SttjsJnEyZuO2JCTp';
update content_bodies set title = 'Izumo Sightseeing Taxi ''Usagi-gō'' Promotional Video (Short Version)', description = 'The ''Izumo Sightseeing Taxi Usagi-gō'' offers guided tours of famous spots in Izumo City. Each taxi is accompanied by a guide who provides easy-to-understand explanations of the history, significance, and highlights of each location. Amid the COVID-19 pandemic, this taxi service ensures a safe and secure way to explore the attractions of Izumo while avoiding crowded places, allowing for a flexible travel experience unique to taxis. For more details, please visit the Izumo Tourism Association website.' where id = 'uPifcYOIh9nA1v5Fb_d_a';
update content_bodies set title = '利尻産ウニの秘密を知るガイドツアー', description = 'この文章は、北海道利尻島の観光情報を提供しています。利尻島の観光やアクティビティに関する詳細は、ぜひ「りしぷら」をご覧ください。ウェブサイトのURLは https://www.rishiri-plus.jp/ です。' where id = 'qtT9fbkyIcBk9qC0745nq';
update content_bodies set title = 'Rishiri Island Sea Urchin Secret Guide Tour', description = 'This text provides tourism information about Rishiri Island in Hokkaido, Japan. For more details on sightseeing and activities on Rishiri Island, please visit ''りしぷら'' at https://www.rishiri-plus.jp/.' where id = 'unAvE0xA1hwrI-SzwS1Nq';
update content_bodies set title = '加太 淡嶋神社 雛流し', description = '三月三日、淡嶋神社では全国から女性たちが集まり、雛流しの神事が行われます。正午に始まるこの神事では、参加者が人形に願い事を書き、舟に乗せます。人形には幼い日の思い出や、幸せを願う気持ちが込められ、舟は次第に人形でいっぱいになります。穏やかな春の海に千羽鶴が舞い、神の国へ続く道が開かれます。お祓いを受けた人形を満載した白木の舟が静かに進み、波に揺られながら人形たちが浮かび沈みします。色鮮やかな着物をまとった人形たちはまるで生きているかのようで、参加者は手を合わせたり、俳句を詠んだり、写真を撮ったりしながら、それぞれの思いを神の国へ流していきます。' where id = 'TalhXHEOap2xBpWzglPBM';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kada Awashima Shrine Hina Nagashi', description = 'On March 3rd, the atmosphere at Awashima Shrine is filled with excitement as women from all over Japan gather with their hopes and wishes. At noon, the solemn Hina Nagashi ceremony begins. Participants write their wishes on dolls and place them on boats. The boats fill with dolls representing heartfelt sentiments, such as memories of childhood or wishes for the happiness of daughters. As the serene spring sea is adorned with a thousand cranes, a path to the divine realm is created. A white wooden boat, carrying the blessed dolls, glides gently into the sea, leading the way. The dolls, dressed in vibrant colors, appear almost alive as they bob on the waves. This moment brings clarity to the heart, with participants praying, composing haiku, taking photos, or simply reflecting, as their wishes flow toward the divine.' where id = 'uRuU801FHFZs2eo-lcfr0';
update content_bodies set title = '加太街並み風物', description = '目の前には友ヶ島があり、遠くには淡路島が見えます。活気ある漁港の雰囲気や豊かな自然、温泉が魅力です。夏には海水浴を楽しむ人々で賑わいます。' where id = 'hSLSVknoKrYfWhQJ_8l7T';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kada Townscape', description = 'In front of you lies Tomogashima, while Awaji Island can be seen in the distance. The area is filled with the lively atmosphere of a fishing port, rich nature, and hot springs. During summer, the beach becomes bustling with visitors enjoying swimming.' where id = 'S8rbG5U2MYOcyz__26QRv';
update content_bodies set title = '13KAMITABI', description = '加美町では、さまざまなアクティビティを紹介する動画をオシャレに制作しました。町の魅力を引き出し、多彩な楽しみ方を伝える内容となっています。' where id = '4jlT5-qy1ODZZpcVA7R3p';
update content_bodies set title = '13KAMITABI', description = 'The video highlights the various activities available in Kamitabi Town, showcasing them in a stylish manner.' where id = '_MIDxtFExTLQOYAxX2-i2';
update content_bodies set title = '「本荘ごてんまり」ってなぁに？【秋田県由利本荘市】', description = '秋田県由利本荘市で愛されている工芸品「本荘ごてんまり」についての説明です。この工芸品の歴史や特徴を「御殿鞠あやめ」ちゃんが詳しく解説してくれます。' where id = 'HgxnRqgXskmg4sFKlfird';
update content_bodies set title = 'What is ''Honjo Gotemari''?【Yurihonjo City, Akita Prefecture】', description = 'Honjo Gotemari is a beloved craft from Yurihonjo City in Akita Prefecture. The history and characteristics of this unique item are explained by Ayame, the character representing Gotemari.' where id = 'AnRhOJEOLldtI4faB-trR';
update content_bodies set title = '【秋田県由利本荘市】深イイ！まちの歴史を知る旅「まち歩き案内人編」', description = '秋田県由利本荘市の観光PR動画で、まち歩き案内人の紹介を行っています。本荘まち歩き案内人の会では、1～2時間のツアーを1組2000円から提供しています。また、岩城まち歩き案内忍の会では、最大25人まで参加可能な2時間のツアーを3000円から実施しています。' where id = '0TGTuh-UCsFvRbX0jGnAP';
update content_bodies set title = 'Exploring the History of Yurihonjo City, Akita Prefecture: A Walking Tour Guide', description = 'This is a promotional video for tourism in Yurihonjo City, Akita Prefecture. It introduces the walking tour guides available in the area. The Honjo Walking Tour Guide Association offers tours for groups starting at 2,000 yen for 1 to 2 hours. The Iwaki Walking Tour Guide Association accommodates up to 25 people for a 2-hour tour starting at 3,000 yen.' where id = 'MFeNfEiX8sLxvfPCkRRtl';
update content_bodies set title = '第71回本荘川まつり花火大会', description = '4年ぶりにナイアガラ花火が復活し、露店や有料席が解禁されます。昨年のYouTubeライブ配信も継続し、NTTの配信チームがサポートします。さらに、リアルとデジタルの融合を目指したメタバース特設会場も設置されます。DJブースには、メインMCの真坂はづきや、よしもと興業の「ちぇす」「きり亭たん坊」、デジタルキャラクター「御殿鞠あやめ」が登場し、リアルタイムアニメーション技術「Live2D」を使って花火の打ち上げ宣言を行います。スケジュールは、19:00にYouTubeライブ配信開始、19:30に花火打ち上げ開始、21:00に終了予定です。メタバース特設会場へのアクセスは、混雑時に制限される場合があります。' where id = '-7H4rlrvh7vjkMmbjxOvS';
update content_bodies set title = '71st Honjo River Festival Fireworks Festival', description = 'After a four-year hiatus, the Niagara fireworks will return, and food stalls and paid seating will be available! The YouTube live streaming, which was attempted last year, will continue this year with full support from NTT''s streaming team. Additionally, a special metaverse venue will be set up to merge the real and digital worlds, marking a first for the event. The DJ booth will feature main MC Hazuki Masaka, Yoshimoto Kogyo''s local comedians ''Chesu'' and ''Kiritate Tanbo,'' along with the digital character ''Ayame Gotembari'' from the Yurihonjo project, who will make a guest appearance. Ayame-chan will announce the fireworks launch using real-time animation technology ''Live2D.'' The schedule includes the YouTube live stream starting at 19:00, fireworks launching at 19:30, and concluding at 21:00. Note that access to the metaverse venue may be limited during peak times.' where id = '69rmE2LZM2B0ehUrxVN2e';
update content_bodies set title = '観光PV：獅子が宿る街、由利本荘市', description = '由利本荘市が誇る無形民俗文化財「本海獅子舞番楽」は、勇壮な獅子舞を中心に、さまざまな演目で舞台を彩ります。舞の美しさだけでなく、衣装やお面の多様性にも注目が集まります。定期公演は民俗芸能伝承館まいーれで行われています。' where id = 'LmRSX0oz19jmF38up7XWb';
update content_bodies set title = 'The City of Lions: Yurihonjo', description = 'Yurihonjo City proudly presents its intangible cultural heritage, the ''Honma Lion Dance Performance.'' This vibrant lion dance is complemented by various performances that enrich the stage. In addition to the dance itself, the diverse costumes and masks are also noteworthy. Regular performances are held at the Folk Performing Arts Heritage Hall, Mai-re.' where id = 'glk9OaNEZQ8MqgqhfwMh1';
update content_bodies set title = '観光PV：絵になる街、由利本荘市', description = 'この観光プロモーションビデオは、由利本荘市と由利高原鉄道を紹介しています。四季折々の美しい風景や古い車両が映し出されており、視覚的に楽しめる内容となっています。また、この動画は市内のデジタルサイネージでも視聴可能です。' where id = '5Rk0r_ahHeyrBK9AKVanR';
update content_bodies set title = 'Scenic City: Yurihonjo City Tourism PV', description = 'This tourism promotional video showcases the Yurihonjo City and the Yurihonjo Kogen Railway. It features various picturesque landscapes that change with the seasons, along with some older train models. The video is also available for viewing on digital signage throughout the city.' where id = '4Ty01tUqEmulK0vbOaYYi';
update content_bodies set title = '第53回全国ごてんまりコンクール【2022年】', description = '第53回全国ごてんまりコンクールが秋田県由利本荘市で開催されました。この歴史あるコンクールには全国から156点の応募がありました。開催日は10月22日と23日の二日間です。受賞者には、福島県の新妻栄子さんが「加茂の思い出」で東北経済産業局長賞を、 新潟県の武士俣やすさんが「ポンポンダリア」で秋田県知事賞を、秋田県の伊藤孝子さんが「花火」で由利本荘市長賞を受賞しました。また、本荘御殿まりを愛する会の代表、阿部登志子さんも出演しました。' where id = 'Cgt09tw0CBrncLzDDWYjw';
update content_bodies set title = '53rd National Gotemari Contest 2022', description = 'The 53rd National Gotemari Contest was held in Yurihonjo City, Akita Prefecture. This historic contest received 156 entries from across the country. The event took place over two days, on October 22 and 23. The winners included Eiko Niizuma from Fukushima Prefecture, who received the Tohoku Bureau of Economy, Trade and Industry Director''s Award for her work ''Memories of Kamo''; Yasushi Bushimata from Niigata Prefecture, who won the Akita Prefectural Governor''s Award for ''Pompon Dalia''; and Takako Ito from Akita Prefecture, who received the Yurihonjo City Mayor''s Award for ''Fireworks''. The event featured a representative from the Honjo Gotemari Lovers'' Association, Toshiko Abe.' where id = 'DyDUib0oYCnJ8oTcODk4u';
update content_bodies set title = '【由利本荘市】2023年4月採用地域おこし協力隊募集PV【観光振興】', description = '秋田県由利本荘市の令和5年度4月採用の地域おこし協力隊募集PR動画です。由利本荘市は鳥海山の北麓に位置し、秋田県一の広さを持つ自治体で、観光は広大なアウトドアフィールドを活かしたレジャーが中心です。しかし、プレイヤーの高齢化や施設の老朽化といった課題があり、世代交代や新たなアウトドアアクティビティ拠点の再整備に向けた取り組みが進められています。次世代の由利本荘市のアウトドアを支える人材を募集しています。詳しくは市のホームページをご覧ください。' where id = 'TZRZY8BO9pefEfob_Ovdo';
update content_bodies set title = 'Recruitment of Regional Revitalization Cooperation Team in Yurihonjo City, April 2023', description = 'This is a promotional video for the recruitment of the Regional Revitalization Cooperation Team in Yurihonjo City, Akita Prefecture, starting in April 2023. Located at the northern foot of Mount Chokai, which straddles the southern end of Akita Prefecture and Yamagata Prefecture, Yurihonjo City is the largest municipality in Akita, connecting the inland area to the Sea of Japan. The city''s tourism focuses on outdoor leisure activities, but it faces challenges such as an aging player base and aging facilities. Efforts are underway to facilitate generational change and to renovate new outdoor activity hubs. We are looking for individuals to support the next generation of outdoor activities in Yurihonjo City. For more details, please visit the city’s official website.' where id = '4IbMPp3wIYoqiKK59hSXR';
update content_bodies set title = '全国ごてんまりコンクール２０２０【秋田県由利本荘市】', description = '秋田県由利本荘市で開催された「第５１回全国ごてんまりコンクール」の様子をお伝えします。このコンクールは2020年10月17日と18日の二日間にわたり行われ、全国から114点の作品が展示されました。技巧を凝らした洗練された工芸品が数多く並び、訪れる人々にその美しさを楽しむ機会を提供しました。' where id = '_5ej-lJWkly2ttLVFlhX_';
update content_bodies set title = '51st National Gotemari Contest 2020 in Yurihonjo City, Akita Prefecture', description = 'The 51st National Gotemari Contest was held in Yurihonjo City, Akita Prefecture, on October 17 and 18, 2020. A total of 114 works from across the country were displayed. The event showcased a variety of sophisticated and skillfully crafted traditional crafts, inviting visitors to appreciate the artistry.' where id = '1Et4hR5ChEe4OC5r6ESM9';
update content_bodies set title = '東京・下北沢での16の楽しみ方：リサイクルショップだけじゃない！', description = '下北沢（通称：下北）は、東京の中心から数駅の距離にあるトレンディでボヘミアンな街です。狭い通りには、ヴィンテージ衣料品店、ユニークなカフェ、ライブハウス、インディファッションの店舗、アーティストのスタジオがひしめき、クリエイティブな人々やお得を求める人々にとってのオアシスとなっています。このガイドでは、抹茶パスポートでの儀式用抹茶の楽しみ方や、地元の市場での掘り出し物探し、羽根木公園でのリラックス、アートギャラリーやライブ音楽の体験など、さまざまなアクティビティが紹介されています。また、キャロットタワーの無料展望台や、リサイクルショップ、ジュエリーショッピング、クラフトビールや飲み放題の居酒屋など、多彩な食の選択肢も魅力です。下北沢には、北沢八幡神社などの文化的な名所や、世田谷代田からの富士山の美しい眺めもあります。' where id = 'dx1SGCVg-Yq6_IelO8cvn';
update content_bodies set title = '16 Things to Do in Shimokitazawa, Tokyo: More Than Just Thrifting!', description = 'Shimokitazawa, often referred to as Shimokita, is a vibrant and bohemian neighborhood located just a few train stops from central Tokyo. Known for its narrow streets filled with vintage clothing shops, quirky cafes, live music venues, indie fashion outlets, and artist studios, it serves as a creative haven for artists and bargain hunters alike. The guide highlights various activities, including enjoying ceremonial grade matcha at Matcha Passport, exploring local markets for deals, relaxing in Hanegi Park, visiting art galleries, and experiencing live music. Other attractions include the free observation deck at Carrot Tower, thrifting opportunities, jewelry shopping, and a variety of food options, including craft beer and all-you-can-drink izakaya. The area also features cultural sites like Kitazawa Hachiman Shrine and offers stunning views of Mount Fuji from Setagaya Daita.' where id = 'TVronDIBiwcWGc1I-OAsk';
update content_bodies set title = 'KUISs×KOBE TOURISM BUREAU', description = '関西国際大学の学生が神戸のホットスポットである「神戸ポートミュージアム(KPM)」の撮影を行いました。撮影から動画編集まで、学生自身が制作に関わっています。この動画には、神戸の魅力的な観光スポットや美味しい食べ物が詰まっており、神戸観光の参考にぜひご覧いただきたい内容です。特別協力として、AQUARIUM ✕ ART átoaとTOOTH TOOTH MART FOOD HALL&NIGHT FESに感謝します。' where id = '1_CNRA5_bUoU5ZItAFkxY';
update content_bodies set title = 'KUISs×KOBE TOURISM BUREAU', description = 'Students from Kansai University of International Studies conducted a filming project at the Kobe Port Museum (KPM), showcasing it as a hot spot in Kobe. The students were involved in all aspects of the project, from filming to video editing. The resulting video is filled with attractions and culinary delights, making it a great reference for anyone interested in visiting Kobe. Special thanks to AQUARIUM × ART átoa and TOOTH TOOTH MART FOOD HALL & NIGHT FES for their contributions.' where id = 'XHQJc4CvCM64-atjdluEA';
update content_bodies set title = '神戸は、地球だ。～ヨーロッパ編～', description = 'この観光PR動画は、日本にいながらヨーロッパ旅行を楽しめる街・神戸を紹介しています。ミラノのオープンカフェでエスプレッソを楽しみ、パリのようなレトロな洋館で本格的な料理を味わい、ドイツの教会の雰囲気のカフェでスイーツを堪能し、南フランスのリゾートのようなホテルにチェックインします。イギリスの古城のような塔から街を見下ろしながら、ふと思うのです。『ここはヨーロッパだっけ？』' where id = 'L1n-kNELOydAjjLQSG0R9';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kobe is the Earth. - Europe Edition -', description = 'This promotional video showcases Kobe as a city where you can experience a European vacation without leaving Japan. Enjoy espresso at an open café reminiscent of Milan, savor authentic cuisine in a retro Western-style mansion like in Paris, indulge in sweets at a café with an atmosphere similar to a German church, and check into a hotel that feels like a resort in Southern France. From a tower resembling an ancient British castle, one might wonder, ''Isn''t this Europe?''' where id = 'EWNzMZHHVmIYuCs77E943';
update content_bodies set title = '神戸は、地球だ。', description = 'このプロモーション動画は、日本にいながらアメリカ旅行を楽しめる街・神戸を紹介しています。西海岸のような可愛いホテルや、シアトルを思わせる開放的なウォーターフロントを散策する様子が描かれています。また、ニューヨークの街角での記念撮影や、サンフランシスコにありそうなレストランでのシーフードを楽しむシーンもあり、ロサンゼルスの美しい砂浜で夕焼けを眺める場面もあります。神戸は、国際的な体験を提供するユニークな場所であることを伝えています。' where id = '24jjG-sp5C4qTRTU9BYlB';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kobe is the Earth.', description = 'This promotional video showcases Kobe as a city where you can experience an American vacation without leaving Japan. It features a charming hotel reminiscent of the West Coast, a stroll along a waterfront similar to Seattle, and photo opportunities on streets that evoke New York. The video also highlights enjoying seafood at a restaurant that feels like it''s in San Francisco, followed by watching a sunset on beautiful beaches akin to those in Los Angeles. The overall message is that Kobe offers a unique blend of international experiences, making it feel like you''re traveling in America.' where id = 'fkSMPP7uTgv1-Rs3lGdP8';
update content_bodies set title = '神戸は、地球だ。', description = 'このプロモーション動画は、日本にいながらアジア旅行を楽しめる街・神戸を紹介しています。旅は上海にありそうな寺院への参拝から始まり、中東の香り漂う通りを散策します。北京の王宮料理をイメージしたランチを楽しんだ後は、台湾にありそうな本格的な茶房で一息つきます。香港の夜市のようなネオンとランタンの灯りを眺めながら、ふと「ここは本当にアジアなのか？」と思わせる体験が広がります。' where id = 'SeX6UQGYhPAkEaQEQ8AJ_';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kobe is the Earth.', description = 'This promotional video showcases Kobe as a city where you can experience an Asian travel adventure without leaving Japan. The journey begins with a visit to a temple reminiscent of those found in Shanghai, followed by a stroll through a street filled with Middle Eastern spices. After enjoying a hearty lunch inspired by Beijing''s royal cuisine, visitors can relax at an authentic tea house that feels like it''s in Taiwan. The vibrant lights of a night market, similar to those in Hong Kong, evoke a sense of wonder, prompting the thought: ''Is this really Asia?''' where id = 'nhEfdkyS2ozUH8TTx1p0_';
update content_bodies set title = '奈良まほろば', description = '奈良まほろばは、東京新橋にある奈良県のブランドショップで、東京にいながら気軽に奈良を感じられる場所です。1階には観光案内コーナーがあり、観光コンシェルジュが旬の情報を提供し、より良い奈良の旅を提案します。奈良の魅力的な商品が揃い、それぞれのストーリーを丁寧に紹介。日常生活に取り入れることで、豊かな暮らしを実現します。また、奈良の食材を使ったかき氷や、日本酒、クラフトビールなどを楽しめるカフェ＆バーもあります。2階のTOKiでは、奈良の生産者と連携し、季節の素材や奈良の風土を感じられる料理を提供。コース料理や単品メニューと共に、ワインや奈良の地酒も楽しめます。' where id = 'FnlkXFF863JWWWtsH50fL';
update content_bodies set title = 'Nara Mahoroba', description = 'Nara Mahoroba is a brand shop located in Shinbashi, Tokyo, showcasing the charm of Nara Prefecture. It offers a space where visitors can easily experience Nara even in Tokyo. The first floor features a tourist information corner with a concierge providing up-to-date information to enhance your travel experience in Nara. The shop presents attractive products from Nara, each with its own story, enriching daily life. The café and bar serve Nara''s famous kakigori (shaved ice) made with local ingredients, as well as sake deeply connected to Nara''s history and craft beers that reflect a new side of Nara. The second floor, TOKi, collaborates with local producers to create seasonal menus that highlight Nara''s ingredients, history, and culture, available as courses or à la carte, paired with wine and local sake.' where id = 'JBKmEK6MSjDu2HCKAHjTd';
update content_bodies set title = '奈良の口福～PRAY, PLAY, NARA～', description = 'この動画では、奈良の食文化の魅力を紹介しています。奈良が提供する独自の料理を楽しむことをお勧めします。' where id = '2pA-Em61_tMPtQBZkRre5';
update content_bodies set title = 'Delicious Nara～PRAY, PLAY, NARA～', description = 'This video showcases the delightful food culture of Nara. It invites viewers to explore and enjoy the unique culinary offerings that Nara has to offer.' where id = 'w39VEoZxkY32jjtBJxzbi';
update content_bodies set title = '深呼吸～PRAY, PLAY, NARA～', description = 'この動画は、奈良の豊かな自然とアウトドアアクティビティを紹介しています。奈良の風景の美しさを楽しみ、アウトドアの魅力に触れていただければ幸いです。' where id = 'DtkeC5IHq4xFT1Qa1dIth';
update content_bodies set title = 'Breathe Deeply～PRAY, PLAY, NARA～', description = 'This video showcases the rich natural environment of Nara and highlights various outdoor activities available in the area. It invites viewers to enjoy the beauty of Nara''s landscapes and engage in its outdoor offerings.' where id = 'uCC56k4ceHfEVrgx-Ze_S';
update content_bodies set title = '大和の祈り～PRAY, PLAY, NARA～', description = 'この動画では、奈良の歴史や文化、自然、食、そして安全・安心について紹介しています。奈良の魅力を楽しんでいただければ幸いです。' where id = 'kzUDmFrRFDOI5bEbdK5UR';
update content_bodies set title = 'Yamato Prays for the World～PRAY, PLAY, NARA～', description = 'This video showcases the rich history and culture of Nara, along with its natural beauty, local cuisine, and aspects of safety and security. It invites viewers to enjoy and appreciate the unique offerings of this historic city.' where id = 'lA2uRAZxKVtNCCvrrUjFn';
update content_bodies set title = '【松山市公式PR動画】 松山城 「段サンブル」', description = '松山市の公式PR動画「段サンブル」では、松山城を舞台に来場者とお城のスタッフがコミカルにダンスを交えて演じています。松山城は、江戸時代以前に建造された天守を持つ12の城の一つで、1602年に築城が始まり、25年かけて完成しました。市内中心部に位置し、天守の最上階からは松山平野や瀬戸内海を一望できます。二之丸から本丸にかけては韓国の倭城の防備手法「登り石垣」があり、堀之内を含む城山公園全体が国の史跡に指定されています。また、21棟が重要文化財に指定されており、2014年にはトリップアドバイザーの「行って良かった！日本の城ランキング」で第2位に選ばれました。松山城は桜の名所としても知られています。' where id = 'ZQwTDxZGE5xLBvXeM13Gy';
update content_bodies set title = 'Matsuyama Castle Official PR Video: Dansanburu', description = 'The official PR video of Matsuyama City features ''Dansanburu,'' a comedic dance performance involving visitors and castle staff at Matsuyama Castle. This castle, one of only twelve in Japan built before the Edo period, began construction in 1602 and took a quarter of a century to complete. Located in the city center, the top floor of the castle offers views of Matsuyama Plain and the Seto Inland Sea. The castle features ''nobori ishigaki,'' a defensive technique from Korean Wajo, between the Ninomaru and Honmaru areas. The entire castle park, including Horinouchi, is designated as a national historic site, with 21 structures recognized as important cultural properties. In 2014, it was ranked second in TripAdvisor''s ''Best Japanese Castles to Visit.'' The castle is also famous for its cherry blossoms.' where id = 'y1GhTdOYOcvNBjehXx2EI';
update content_bodies set title = '「松山・東温・砥部」広域観光映像', description = '松山市、東温市、砥部町には、豊かな自然や伝統文化を楽しむことができるスポットが多数存在します。これらの魅力を魅力的な映像で紹介しています。' where id = '6jvYHH1jYNxZBl8FpA9rA';